    <item>
      <title>Mount Etna may be like no other volcano on Earth</title>
      <link>https://newatlas.com/physics/mount-etna-may-be-like-no-other-volcano-on-earth/</link>
      <description><![CDATA[<p><img src="https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/f63b39c/2147483647/strip/true/crop/2000x1500+0+0/resize/1280x960!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F3d%2F79%2F36e101564bf3bd9713a04130656e%2Fmount-etna-volcano.jpg" srcset="https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/bfd5eb9/2147483647/strip/true/crop/2000x1500+0+0/resize/440x330!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F3d%2F79%2F36e101564bf3bd9713a04130656e%2Fmount-etna-volcano.jpg 440w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/efd5b91/2147483647/strip/true/crop/2000x1500+0+0/resize/725x544!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F3d%2F79%2F36e101564bf3bd9713a04130656e%2Fmount-etna-volcano.jpg 725w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/7ed274a/2147483647/strip/true/crop/2000x1500+0+0/resize/800x600!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F3d%2F79%2F36e101564bf3bd9713a04130656e%2Fmount-etna-volcano.jpg 800w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/a6f9a71/2147483647/strip/true/crop/2000x1500+0+0/resize/1200x900!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F3d%2F79%2F36e101564bf3bd9713a04130656e%2Fmount-etna-volcano.jpg 1200w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/28729c5/2147483647/strip/true/crop/2000x1500+0+0/resize/1920x1440!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F3d%2F79%2F36e101564bf3bd9713a04130656e%2Fmount-etna-volcano.jpg 1920w" alt="Photograph of Mt Etna" /><p>Europe's most active volcano, Mount Etna, has always been a geological puzzle. The Sicilian volcano has erupted several times a year, and glassy peaks of over 3,000 meters (10,000 feet) have fascinated scientists for decades. Though renowned, Etna has stubbornly defied categorization in the traditional volcano lifecycle.</p><p><a href="https://newatlas.com/physics/mount-etna-may-be-like-no-other-volcano-on-earth/">Continue Reading</a></p><p><b>Category:</b> <a href="https://refractor.io/physics/">Physics</a>, <a href="https://refractor.io/science/">Science</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/rf/">Refractor: Science &amp; Health</a></p><p><b>Tags:</b> <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/volcano/" rel="tag">volcano</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/geology/" rel="tag">Geology</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/earth/" rel="tag">Earth</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/italy/" rel="tag">Italy</a></p>]]></description>
      <pubDate>Sun, 26 Jul 2026 23:36:38 GMT</pubDate>
      <guid>https://newatlas.com/physics/mount-etna-may-be-like-no-other-volcano-on-earth/</guid>
      <dc:creator>Pranjal Malewar</dc:creator>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Tornyol drone uses sonar to hunt and destroy mosquitoes</title>
      <link>https://newatlas.com/drones/tornyol-mosquito-hunting-drone/</link>
      <description><![CDATA[<p><img src="https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/7fb7223/2147483647/strip/true/crop/1566x1044+0+0/resize/1440x960!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2Fd9%2Fac%2F2a4735d742568b47466f19572440%2Fvideoframe-1782.jpeg" srcset="https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/386e704/2147483647/strip/true/crop/1566x1044+0+0/resize/440x293!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2Fd9%2Fac%2F2a4735d742568b47466f19572440%2Fvideoframe-1782.jpeg 440w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/46a64d0/2147483647/strip/true/crop/1566x1044+0+0/resize/725x483!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2Fd9%2Fac%2F2a4735d742568b47466f19572440%2Fvideoframe-1782.jpeg 725w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/459b987/2147483647/strip/true/crop/1566x1044+0+0/resize/800x533!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2Fd9%2Fac%2F2a4735d742568b47466f19572440%2Fvideoframe-1782.jpeg 800w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/f3ee697/2147483647/strip/true/crop/1566x1044+0+0/resize/1200x800!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2Fd9%2Fac%2F2a4735d742568b47466f19572440%2Fvideoframe-1782.jpeg 1200w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/47e5f65/2147483647/strip/true/crop/1566x1044+0+0/resize/1920x1280!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2Fd9%2Fac%2F2a4735d742568b47466f19572440%2Fvideoframe-1782.jpeg 1920w" alt="Tornyol's LeSonar2 drone utilizes 32 ultrasonic emitters to locate mosquitoes – and it uses its propellers to dispatch them" /><p>The deadliest animal to have ever roamed the earth is not the great white shark, or snakes, or even rats that caused three great plagues in history, decimating the human population at the time. It’s the tiny 5-mm (0.2-inch) Anopheles mosquito, which has accounted for billions of deaths in history. One company is taking the battle against these deadly insects directly to the skies with tiny air-to-air killer drones.</p><p><a href="https://newatlas.com/drones/tornyol-mosquito-hunting-drone/">Continue Reading</a></p><p><b>Category:</b> <a href="https://newatlas.com/drones/">Drones</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/consumer-tech/">Consumer Tech</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/technology/">Technology</a></p><p><b>Tags:</b> <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/mosquito/" rel="tag">Mosquito</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/insect/" rel="tag">Insect</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/pests/" rel="tag">Pests</a></p>]]></description>
      <pubDate>Sun, 26 Jul 2026 20:03:00 GMT</pubDate>
      <guid>https://newatlas.com/drones/tornyol-mosquito-hunting-drone/</guid>
      <dc:creator>Etiido Uko</dc:creator>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>5-day dog tracker jumps on Starlink when cell signal fails</title>
      <link>https://newatlas.com/outdoors/fi-ultra-dog-tracker-starlink/</link>
      <description><![CDATA[<p><img src="https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/602f2f9/2147483647/strip/true/crop/1200x847+0+0/resize/1200x847!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2Ff5%2F0a%2F4a4998204e589ce6a108062c112f%2Ffiultra-image1.jpeg" srcset="https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/4ff6d1a/2147483647/strip/true/crop/1200x847+0+0/resize/440x311!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2Ff5%2F0a%2F4a4998204e589ce6a108062c112f%2Ffiultra-image1.jpeg 440w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/687e9e9/2147483647/strip/true/crop/1200x847+0+0/resize/725x512!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2Ff5%2F0a%2F4a4998204e589ce6a108062c112f%2Ffiultra-image1.jpeg 725w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/3e70f46/2147483647/strip/true/crop/1200x847+0+0/resize/800x565!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2Ff5%2F0a%2F4a4998204e589ce6a108062c112f%2Ffiultra-image1.jpeg 800w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/602f2f9/2147483647/strip/true/crop/1200x847+0+0/resize/1200x847!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2Ff5%2F0a%2F4a4998204e589ce6a108062c112f%2Ffiultra-image1.jpeg 1200w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/a81530f/2147483647/strip/true/crop/1200x847+0+0/resize/1920x1355!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2Ff5%2F0a%2F4a4998204e589ce6a108062c112f%2Ffiultra-image1.jpeg 1920w" alt="Designed for off-grid adventures, the tracker provides essential location security during quiet downtime in the wilderness" /><p>GPS pet trackers have an obvious limitation: they’re only useful if there's adequate coverage. In most cities, suburbs, and neighborhood parks, you should be fine. But if you’re out on a hike or exploring the countryside with your dog, the open land can expose that weak point – just when your dog is farthest from help.</p><p><a href="https://newatlas.com/outdoors/fi-ultra-dog-tracker-starlink/">Continue Reading</a></p><p><b>Category:</b> <a href="https://newatlas.com/outdoors/">Outdoors</a></p><p><b>Tags:</b> <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/tracking/" rel="tag">Tracking</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/dog-collar/" rel="tag">dog collar</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/dogs/" rel="tag">Dogs</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/satellite/" rel="tag">Satellite</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/gps/" rel="tag">GPS</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/starlink/" rel="tag">Starlink</a></p>]]></description>
      <pubDate>Sun, 26 Jul 2026 15:03:00 GMT</pubDate>
      <guid>https://newatlas.com/outdoors/fi-ultra-dog-tracker-starlink/</guid>
      <dc:creator>Monica J. White</dc:creator>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Savvy cycling components flatten your bike for indoor storage</title>
      <link>https://newatlas.com/bicycles/flatbike-flatten-bike-indoor-storage/</link>
      <description><![CDATA[<p><img src="https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/d50182a/2147483647/strip/true/crop/4624x3472+0+0/resize/1279x960!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F1b%2Fa6%2Fb93f131342da81382a63077a2f46%2Fclose-up-2-folded.jpeg" srcset="https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/20a53d5/2147483647/strip/true/crop/4624x3472+0+0/resize/440x330!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F1b%2Fa6%2Fb93f131342da81382a63077a2f46%2Fclose-up-2-folded.jpeg 440w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/cb22dcf/2147483647/strip/true/crop/4624x3472+0+0/resize/725x544!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F1b%2Fa6%2Fb93f131342da81382a63077a2f46%2Fclose-up-2-folded.jpeg 725w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/f753072/2147483647/strip/true/crop/4624x3472+0+0/resize/800x600!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F1b%2Fa6%2Fb93f131342da81382a63077a2f46%2Fclose-up-2-folded.jpeg 800w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/e03e5d9/2147483647/strip/true/crop/4624x3472+0+0/resize/1200x901!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F1b%2Fa6%2Fb93f131342da81382a63077a2f46%2Fclose-up-2-folded.jpeg 1200w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/15f1148/2147483647/strip/true/crop/4624x3472+0+0/resize/1920x1441!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F1b%2Fa6%2Fb93f131342da81382a63077a2f46%2Fclose-up-2-folded.jpeg 1920w" alt="null" /><p>Trying to maneuver a bike through tight indoor spaces typically necessitates painstakingly angling the handlebars around doorframes and other obstacles, taking care not to knock the pedals into paintwork or snag them on furniture.</p><p><a href="https://newatlas.com/bicycles/flatbike-flatten-bike-indoor-storage/">Continue Reading</a></p><p><b>Category:</b> <a href="https://newatlas.com/bicycles/">Bicycles</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/transport/">Transport</a></p><p><b>Tags:</b> <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/cycling/" rel="tag">Cycling</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/storage/" rel="tag">Storage</a></p>]]></description>
      <pubDate>Sun, 26 Jul 2026 12:03:00 GMT</pubDate>
      <guid>https://newatlas.com/bicycles/flatbike-flatten-bike-indoor-storage/</guid>
      <dc:creator>Shirl Leigh</dc:creator>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Skullcandy's new over-ears bring Bose sound to bassheads on a budget</title>
      <link>https://newatlas.com/consumer-tech/skullcandy-crusher-1080-anc-headphones/</link>
      <description><![CDATA[<p><img src="https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/ae46079/2147483647/strip/true/crop/1946x1946+0+0/resize/960x960!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F9f%2F5e%2F2a9ad3cb4ccd9e7df2e371ea87cb%2Fat-over-13-oz-the-1080s-are-a-fair-bit-heavier-than-most-other-wireless-headphones-but-maybe-thats-the-price-you-pay-for-sensory-bass.jpg" srcset="https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/7e795ab/2147483647/strip/true/crop/1946x1946+0+0/resize/440x440!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F9f%2F5e%2F2a9ad3cb4ccd9e7df2e371ea87cb%2Fat-over-13-oz-the-1080s-are-a-fair-bit-heavier-than-most-other-wireless-headphones-but-maybe-thats-the-price-you-pay-for-sensory-bass.jpg 440w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/685b074/2147483647/strip/true/crop/1946x1946+0+0/resize/725x725!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F9f%2F5e%2F2a9ad3cb4ccd9e7df2e371ea87cb%2Fat-over-13-oz-the-1080s-are-a-fair-bit-heavier-than-most-other-wireless-headphones-but-maybe-thats-the-price-you-pay-for-sensory-bass.jpg 725w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/8a7c17f/2147483647/strip/true/crop/1946x1946+0+0/resize/800x800!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F9f%2F5e%2F2a9ad3cb4ccd9e7df2e371ea87cb%2Fat-over-13-oz-the-1080s-are-a-fair-bit-heavier-than-most-other-wireless-headphones-but-maybe-thats-the-price-you-pay-for-sensory-bass.jpg 800w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/205a279/2147483647/strip/true/crop/1946x1946+0+0/resize/1200x1200!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F9f%2F5e%2F2a9ad3cb4ccd9e7df2e371ea87cb%2Fat-over-13-oz-the-1080s-are-a-fair-bit-heavier-than-most-other-wireless-headphones-but-maybe-thats-the-price-you-pay-for-sensory-bass.jpg 1200w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/8a5f67c/2147483647/strip/true/crop/1946x1946+0+0/resize/1920x1920!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F9f%2F5e%2F2a9ad3cb4ccd9e7df2e371ea87cb%2Fat-over-13-oz-the-1080s-are-a-fair-bit-heavier-than-most-other-wireless-headphones-but-maybe-thats-the-price-you-pay-for-sensory-bass.jpg 1920w" alt="At over 13 oz, the 1080s are a fair bit heavier than most other wireless headphones – but maybe that's the price you pay for sensory bass" /><p>Skullcandy says it's pulled out all the stops in developing its latest pair of over-ear headphones, and it even asked Bose for a helping hand.</p><p><a href="https://newatlas.com/consumer-tech/skullcandy-crusher-1080-anc-headphones/">Continue Reading</a></p><p><b>Category:</b> <a href="https://newatlas.com/consumer-tech/">Consumer Tech</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/technology/">Technology</a></p><p><b>Tags:</b> <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/headphones/" rel="tag">Headphones</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/noise-canceling/" rel="tag">Noise-Canceling</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/skullcandy/" rel="tag">Skullcandy</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/bose/" rel="tag">Bose</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/audio/" rel="tag">Audio</a></p>]]></description>
      <pubDate>Sun, 26 Jul 2026 08:03:00 GMT</pubDate>
      <guid>https://newatlas.com/consumer-tech/skullcandy-crusher-1080-anc-headphones/</guid>
      <dc:creator>Abhimanyu Ghoshal</dc:creator>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>High-value CFMoto adventure tourer smooths ride with smart suspension</title>
      <link>https://newatlas.com/motorcycles/cfmoto-800mtes-self-adjusting-suspension/</link>
      <description><![CDATA[<p><img src="https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/90113e4/2147483647/strip/true/crop/1920x1332+0+0/resize/1384x960!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2Fbd%2Fb6%2F8051b60441a084fbb30f03b4b31a%2Felectronically-controlled-suspension-and-a-host-of-other-tech-features-make-the-new-800mt-es-a-tempting-choice.jpg" srcset="https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/60d3605/2147483647/strip/true/crop/1920x1332+0+0/resize/440x305!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2Fbd%2Fb6%2F8051b60441a084fbb30f03b4b31a%2Felectronically-controlled-suspension-and-a-host-of-other-tech-features-make-the-new-800mt-es-a-tempting-choice.jpg 440w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/e7a509e/2147483647/strip/true/crop/1920x1332+0+0/resize/725x503!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2Fbd%2Fb6%2F8051b60441a084fbb30f03b4b31a%2Felectronically-controlled-suspension-and-a-host-of-other-tech-features-make-the-new-800mt-es-a-tempting-choice.jpg 725w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/04e7282/2147483647/strip/true/crop/1920x1332+0+0/resize/800x555!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2Fbd%2Fb6%2F8051b60441a084fbb30f03b4b31a%2Felectronically-controlled-suspension-and-a-host-of-other-tech-features-make-the-new-800mt-es-a-tempting-choice.jpg 800w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/f3b036f/2147483647/strip/true/crop/1920x1332+0+0/resize/1200x832!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2Fbd%2Fb6%2F8051b60441a084fbb30f03b4b31a%2Felectronically-controlled-suspension-and-a-host-of-other-tech-features-make-the-new-800mt-es-a-tempting-choice.jpg 1200w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/66d2a4a/2147483647/strip/true/crop/1920x1332+0+0/resize/1920x1332!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2Fbd%2Fb6%2F8051b60441a084fbb30f03b4b31a%2Felectronically-controlled-suspension-and-a-host-of-other-tech-features-make-the-new-800mt-es-a-tempting-choice.jpg 1920w" alt="Electronically controlled suspension and a host of other tech features make the new 800MT-ES a tempting choice" /><p>CFMoto got mile-munching adventure seekers drooling at last year's EICMA show when it revealed the 800MT-ES, which combined a punchy 799cc parallel-twin mill with a raft of riding aids. It's finally rolling out, starting with dealerships across the UK – at an awfully compelling price.</p><p><a href="https://newatlas.com/motorcycles/cfmoto-800mtes-self-adjusting-suspension/">Continue Reading</a></p><p><b>Category:</b> <a href="https://newatlas.com/motorcycles/">Motorcycles</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/transport/">Transport</a></p><p><b>Tags:</b> <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/cfmoto/" rel="tag">CFMoto</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/adventure-bikes/" rel="tag">Adventure Bikes</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/active-suspension/" rel="tag">Active Suspension</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/suspension/" rel="tag">Suspension</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/touring/" rel="tag">Touring</a></p>]]></description>
      <pubDate>Sun, 26 Jul 2026 04:03:00 GMT</pubDate>
      <guid>https://newatlas.com/motorcycles/cfmoto-800mtes-self-adjusting-suspension/</guid>
      <dc:creator>Abhimanyu Ghoshal</dc:creator>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Stark Future launches Varg "Factory Edition" off-road e-motos</title>
      <link>https://newatlas.com/motorcycles/stark-varg-factory-editions/</link>
      <description><![CDATA[<p><img src="https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/9e7bc87/2147483647/strip/true/crop/8192x5464+0+0/resize/1439x960!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F78%2Fdd%2F365f77724becb67b0893248a04c3%2F58a9436.jpg" srcset="https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/df57cf9/2147483647/strip/true/crop/8192x5464+0+0/resize/440x294!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F78%2Fdd%2F365f77724becb67b0893248a04c3%2F58a9436.jpg 440w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/1cd66fb/2147483647/strip/true/crop/8192x5464+0+0/resize/725x484!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F78%2Fdd%2F365f77724becb67b0893248a04c3%2F58a9436.jpg 725w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/ca5f185/2147483647/strip/true/crop/8192x5464+0+0/resize/800x534!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F78%2Fdd%2F365f77724becb67b0893248a04c3%2F58a9436.jpg 800w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/88830da/2147483647/strip/true/crop/8192x5464+0+0/resize/1200x801!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F78%2Fdd%2F365f77724becb67b0893248a04c3%2F58a9436.jpg 1200w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/c3fd1b1/2147483647/strip/true/crop/8192x5464+0+0/resize/1920x1281!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F78%2Fdd%2F365f77724becb67b0893248a04c3%2F58a9436.jpg 1920w" alt="Stark goes all out on race-spec components for its Varg MX and EX e-motos" /><p>Just when you thought Stark Future couldn’t possibly outdo its Varg MX and EX off-road electric motorcycles, it goes on to launch limited-edition “Factory-edition” versions of the two fitted with all the bells and whistles you could have asked for.</p><p><a href="https://newatlas.com/motorcycles/stark-varg-factory-editions/">Continue Reading</a></p><p><b>Category:</b> <a href="https://newatlas.com/motorcycles/">Motorcycles</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/transport/">Transport</a></p><p><b>Tags:</b> <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/electric+motorcycle/" rel="tag">Electric Motorcycles</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/stark-future/" rel="tag">stark</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/enduro/" rel="tag">Enduro</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/off-road/" rel="tag">Off-road</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/dirt-bikes/" rel="tag">Dirt Bikes</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/racing/" rel="tag">Racing</a></p>]]></description>
      <pubDate>Sat, 25 Jul 2026 21:03:00 GMT</pubDate>
      <guid>https://newatlas.com/motorcycles/stark-varg-factory-editions/</guid>
      <dc:creator>Utkarsh Sood</dc:creator>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Beyond 1,500 hp: Why the Denza Z isn’t just another Porsche 911 clone</title>
      <link>https://newatlas.com/automotive/denza-z/</link>
      <description><![CDATA[<p><img src="https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/5e65d5c/2147483647/strip/true/crop/7954x5302+0+0/resize/1440x960!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F7f%2F8f%2F6c20a7e74a7fa57e3d0fad95d8b7%2Fbaz-1498.jpg" srcset="https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/8c14eb7/2147483647/strip/true/crop/7954x5302+0+0/resize/440x293!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F7f%2F8f%2F6c20a7e74a7fa57e3d0fad95d8b7%2Fbaz-1498.jpg 440w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/744797b/2147483647/strip/true/crop/7954x5302+0+0/resize/725x483!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F7f%2F8f%2F6c20a7e74a7fa57e3d0fad95d8b7%2Fbaz-1498.jpg 725w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/046045a/2147483647/strip/true/crop/7954x5302+0+0/resize/800x533!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F7f%2F8f%2F6c20a7e74a7fa57e3d0fad95d8b7%2Fbaz-1498.jpg 800w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/8e13a53/2147483647/strip/true/crop/7954x5302+0+0/resize/1200x800!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F7f%2F8f%2F6c20a7e74a7fa57e3d0fad95d8b7%2Fbaz-1498.jpg 1200w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/a18b1fd/2147483647/strip/true/crop/7954x5302+0+0/resize/1920x1280!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F7f%2F8f%2F6c20a7e74a7fa57e3d0fad95d8b7%2Fbaz-1498.jpg 1920w" alt="The Denza Z starts from 680,000 yuan (US$100,300) in China, rising to £142,900 (US$184,800) in the UK" /><p>I’ll admit, it’s tough to keep tabs on BYD purely because the Chinese company seems to launch a new EV every month. And if that wasn't enough, its offshoots like Yangwang and Denza add even more numbers to the lineup. So naturally, we don’t cover every BYD launch. But this one’s an exception.</p><p><a href="https://newatlas.com/automotive/denza-z/">Continue Reading</a></p><p><b>Category:</b> <a href="https://newatlas.com/automotive/">Automotive</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/transport/">Transport</a></p><p><b>Tags:</b> <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/byd/" rel="tag">BYD</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/supercar/" rel="tag">Supercar</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/hypercar/" rel="tag">Hypercar</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/electric+vehicle/" rel="tag">Electric Vehicles</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/porsche/" rel="tag">Porsche</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/911/" rel="tag">911</a></p>]]></description>
      <pubDate>Sat, 25 Jul 2026 17:03:00 GMT</pubDate>
      <guid>https://newatlas.com/automotive/denza-z/</guid>
      <dc:creator>Utkarsh Sood</dc:creator>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>'Dopamine apps' let people fake order food and shop online</title>
      <link>https://refractor.io/addiction/dopamine-apps-food-shop-online/</link>
      <description><![CDATA[<p><img src="https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/b470776/2147483647/strip/true/crop/6720x4480+0+0/resize/1440x960!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2Fe4%2F74%2F39a694b94ca4bea5747de65b1fea%2Fdepositphotos-357369780-xl.jpg" srcset="https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/2128a71/2147483647/strip/true/crop/6720x4480+0+0/resize/440x293!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2Fe4%2F74%2F39a694b94ca4bea5747de65b1fea%2Fdepositphotos-357369780-xl.jpg 440w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/3e542d3/2147483647/strip/true/crop/6720x4480+0+0/resize/725x483!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2Fe4%2F74%2F39a694b94ca4bea5747de65b1fea%2Fdepositphotos-357369780-xl.jpg 725w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/ed6efc9/2147483647/strip/true/crop/6720x4480+0+0/resize/800x533!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2Fe4%2F74%2F39a694b94ca4bea5747de65b1fea%2Fdepositphotos-357369780-xl.jpg 800w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/c55e5f3/2147483647/strip/true/crop/6720x4480+0+0/resize/1200x800!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2Fe4%2F74%2F39a694b94ca4bea5747de65b1fea%2Fdepositphotos-357369780-xl.jpg 1200w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/1d1e316/2147483647/strip/true/crop/6720x4480+0+0/resize/1920x1280!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2Fe4%2F74%2F39a694b94ca4bea5747de65b1fea%2Fdepositphotos-357369780-xl.jpg 1920w" alt="Fake food delivery and online shopping apps help scratch an itch – but there's a downside" /><p>Gary Mortimer, Queensland University of Technology/The Conversation</p><p><a href="https://refractor.io/addiction/dopamine-apps-food-shop-online/">Continue Reading</a></p><p><b>Category:</b> <a href="https://refractor.io/addiction/">Addiction</a>, <a href="https://refractor.io/brain/">Brain Health</a>, <a href="https://refractor.io/medical/">Body and Mind</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/rf/">Refractor: Science &amp; Health</a></p><p><b>Tags:</b> <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/food/" rel="tag">Food</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/gambling/" rel="tag">gambling</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/dopamine/" rel="tag">Dopamine</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/neuroscience/" rel="tag">Neuroscience</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/advertising/" rel="tag">Advertising</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/market/" rel="tag">Market</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/payment-technology/" rel="tag">Payment Technology</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/consumers/" rel="tag">Consumers</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/app/" rel="tag">Apps</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/online-shopping/" rel="tag">Online Shopping</a></p>]]></description>
      <pubDate>Sat, 25 Jul 2026 15:28:00 GMT</pubDate>
      <guid>https://refractor.io/addiction/dopamine-apps-food-shop-online/</guid>
      <dc:creator>The Conversation</dc:creator>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Tern's HSD Gen 3 cargo ebike offers heavy hauling in a compact form</title>
      <link>https://newatlas.com/bicycles/tern-hsd-gen3-cargo-ebike/</link>
      <description><![CDATA[<p><img src="https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/8e8c839/2147483647/strip/true/crop/1200x800+0+0/resize/1200x800!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F7c%2F17%2F1e44f4814d08bca984694203bdba%2Fternhsd-image2.jpg" srcset="https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/4f2d436/2147483647/strip/true/crop/1200x800+0+0/resize/440x293!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F7c%2F17%2F1e44f4814d08bca984694203bdba%2Fternhsd-image2.jpg 440w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/9de781c/2147483647/strip/true/crop/1200x800+0+0/resize/725x483!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F7c%2F17%2F1e44f4814d08bca984694203bdba%2Fternhsd-image2.jpg 725w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/6a4097d/2147483647/strip/true/crop/1200x800+0+0/resize/800x533!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F7c%2F17%2F1e44f4814d08bca984694203bdba%2Fternhsd-image2.jpg 800w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/8e8c839/2147483647/strip/true/crop/1200x800+0+0/resize/1200x800!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F7c%2F17%2F1e44f4814d08bca984694203bdba%2Fternhsd-image2.jpg 1200w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/33ae011/2147483647/strip/true/crop/1200x800+0+0/resize/1920x1280!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F7c%2F17%2F1e44f4814d08bca984694203bdba%2Fternhsd-image2.jpg 1920w" alt="Powered by Bosch’s updated Gen 5 drive system, the new HSD3 delivers smoother, quieter pedal assistance across the updated lineup" /><p>Cargo bikes make a lot of sense on paper. They can take care of school runs, shopping, kids, pets, and the kind of short trips that you really don’t need a car for. The catch is that many of them are large, heavy, and awkward to store, especially if you live in an apartment building with narrow hallways, stairs, elevators, or not quite enough garage space.</p><p><a href="https://newatlas.com/bicycles/tern-hsd-gen3-cargo-ebike/">Continue Reading</a></p><p><b>Category:</b> <a href="https://newatlas.com/bicycles/">Bicycles</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/transport/">Transport</a></p><p><b>Tags:</b> <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/tern/" rel="tag">Tern</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/ebikes/" rel="tag">ebikes</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/cargo-bike/" rel="tag">cargo bike</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/pedal-assisted/" rel="tag">Pedal-assisted</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/bosch/" rel="tag">Bosch</a></p>]]></description>
      <pubDate>Sat, 25 Jul 2026 12:03:00 GMT</pubDate>
      <guid>https://newatlas.com/bicycles/tern-hsd-gen3-cargo-ebike/</guid>
      <dc:creator>Monica J. White</dc:creator>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>$15K electric 'LUV' promises to park and drive itself home</title>
      <link>https://newatlas.com/automotive/15k-beach-buggy-is-a-life-size-rc-car-that-carries-actual-passengers/</link>
      <description><![CDATA[<p><img src="https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/3e3becf/2147483647/strip/true/crop/1200x800+0+0/resize/1200x800!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F38%2F74%2Fad382af84b2d8f725e691a6613c6%2Fchip-motors-luv-is-designed-for-good-times-under-25-mph.jpg" srcset="https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/00344cf/2147483647/strip/true/crop/1200x800+0+0/resize/440x293!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F38%2F74%2Fad382af84b2d8f725e691a6613c6%2Fchip-motors-luv-is-designed-for-good-times-under-25-mph.jpg 440w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/452a7be/2147483647/strip/true/crop/1200x800+0+0/resize/725x483!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F38%2F74%2Fad382af84b2d8f725e691a6613c6%2Fchip-motors-luv-is-designed-for-good-times-under-25-mph.jpg 725w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/4dcb1fe/2147483647/strip/true/crop/1200x800+0+0/resize/800x533!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F38%2F74%2Fad382af84b2d8f725e691a6613c6%2Fchip-motors-luv-is-designed-for-good-times-under-25-mph.jpg 800w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/3e3becf/2147483647/strip/true/crop/1200x800+0+0/resize/1200x800!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F38%2F74%2Fad382af84b2d8f725e691a6613c6%2Fchip-motors-luv-is-designed-for-good-times-under-25-mph.jpg 1200w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/2b1a439/2147483647/strip/true/crop/1200x800+0+0/resize/1920x1280!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F38%2F74%2Fad382af84b2d8f725e691a6613c6%2Fchip-motors-luv-is-designed-for-good-times-under-25-mph.jpg 1920w" alt="Chip Motors' LUV is designed for good times under 25 mph" /><p>A new EV startup is betting that more people will choose a right-sized family vehicle for everyday trips in and around their neighborhoods. That includes trips without anyone in the car.</p><p><a href="https://newatlas.com/automotive/15k-beach-buggy-is-a-life-size-rc-car-that-carries-actual-passengers/">Continue Reading</a></p><p><b>Category:</b> <a href="https://newatlas.com/automotive/">Automotive</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/transport/">Transport</a></p><p><b>Tags:</b> <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/urban-transport/" rel="tag">urban transport</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/electric+vehicle/" rel="tag">Electric Vehicles</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/low-speed-vehicle/" rel="tag">Low-speed vehicle (LSV)</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/autonomous-vehicle/" rel="tag">Autonomous Vehicles</a></p>]]></description>
      <pubDate>Sat, 25 Jul 2026 08:03:00 GMT</pubDate>
      <guid>https://newatlas.com/automotive/15k-beach-buggy-is-a-life-size-rc-car-that-carries-actual-passengers/</guid>
      <dc:creator>Abhimanyu Ghoshal</dc:creator>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>BAE Systems unveils Brontanax autonomous loyal wingman</title>
      <link>https://newatlas.com/military/bae-systems-brontanax-loyal-wingman/</link>
      <description><![CDATA[<p><img src="https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/70acdff/2147483647/strip/true/crop/1220x573+0+0/resize/1220x573!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F88%2F05%2Fc989959c461aa904737a3698cefa%2Fscreenshot-2026-07-24-162031.png" srcset="https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/3383b9d/2147483647/strip/true/crop/1220x573+0+0/resize/440x207!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F88%2F05%2Fc989959c461aa904737a3698cefa%2Fscreenshot-2026-07-24-162031.png 440w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/b16aae7/2147483647/strip/true/crop/1220x573+0+0/resize/725x341!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F88%2F05%2Fc989959c461aa904737a3698cefa%2Fscreenshot-2026-07-24-162031.png 725w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/1d2c70a/2147483647/strip/true/crop/1220x573+0+0/resize/800x376!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F88%2F05%2Fc989959c461aa904737a3698cefa%2Fscreenshot-2026-07-24-162031.png 800w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/4eaf1ef/2147483647/strip/true/crop/1220x573+0+0/resize/1200x564!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F88%2F05%2Fc989959c461aa904737a3698cefa%2Fscreenshot-2026-07-24-162031.png 1200w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/c6b0648/2147483647/strip/true/crop/1220x573+0+0/resize/1920x902!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F88%2F05%2Fc989959c461aa904737a3698cefa%2Fscreenshot-2026-07-24-162031.png 1920w" alt="David Szondy/New Atlas" /><p>BAE Systems unveiled a full-scale mock-up of its newly announced Brontanax autonomous strike plane at this year's Farnborough International Air Show. It is billed as Britain's first home-designed uncrewed autonomous Collaborative Combat Aircraft.</p><p><a href="https://newatlas.com/military/bae-systems-brontanax-loyal-wingman/">Continue Reading</a></p><p><b>Category:</b> <a href="https://newatlas.com/military/">Military</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/engineering/">Engineering</a></p><p><b>Tags:</b> <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/drones/" rel="tag">drones</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/bae-systems/" rel="tag">BAE Systems</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/aircraft/" rel="tag">Aircraft</a></p>]]></description>
      <pubDate>Sat, 25 Jul 2026 04:46:38 GMT</pubDate>
      <guid>https://newatlas.com/military/bae-systems-brontanax-loyal-wingman/</guid>
      <dc:creator>David Szondy</dc:creator>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>OpenAI launches Codex Micro hardware for AI coding</title>
      <link>https://newatlas.com/computers/openai-codex-micro-keyboard/</link>
      <description><![CDATA[<p><img src="https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/04921ec/2147483647/strip/true/crop/2440x1626+0+0/resize/1440x960!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2Fb9%2Fc1%2F075b25a0485195fe39b24ff3e49a%2Fscreenshot-2026-07-23-at-1-29-45-pm.jpeg" srcset="https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/72df0b6/2147483647/strip/true/crop/2440x1626+0+0/resize/440x293!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2Fb9%2Fc1%2F075b25a0485195fe39b24ff3e49a%2Fscreenshot-2026-07-23-at-1-29-45-pm.jpeg 440w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/8a30891/2147483647/strip/true/crop/2440x1626+0+0/resize/725x483!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2Fb9%2Fc1%2F075b25a0485195fe39b24ff3e49a%2Fscreenshot-2026-07-23-at-1-29-45-pm.jpeg 725w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/de59c07/2147483647/strip/true/crop/2440x1626+0+0/resize/800x533!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2Fb9%2Fc1%2F075b25a0485195fe39b24ff3e49a%2Fscreenshot-2026-07-23-at-1-29-45-pm.jpeg 800w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/b3db42e/2147483647/strip/true/crop/2440x1626+0+0/resize/1200x800!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2Fb9%2Fc1%2F075b25a0485195fe39b24ff3e49a%2Fscreenshot-2026-07-23-at-1-29-45-pm.jpeg 1200w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/a5ecbc0/2147483647/strip/true/crop/2440x1626+0+0/resize/1920x1280!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2Fb9%2Fc1%2F075b25a0485195fe39b24ff3e49a%2Fscreenshot-2026-07-23-at-1-29-45-pm.jpeg 1920w" alt="OpenAI's Codex Micro keyboard has just 13 mechanical switches" /><p>OpenAI, the AI lab that brought us ChatGPT, which simultaneously evoked awe, fear, and fascination when it first launched in 2023, has released its first-ever hardware product, a $230 mini-keyboard that’s designed to enhance the workflow of users of Codex, the company’s specialized AI coding agent.</p><p><a href="https://newatlas.com/computers/openai-codex-micro-keyboard/">Continue Reading</a></p><p><b>Category:</b> <a href="https://newatlas.com/computers/">Computing</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/consumer-tech/">Consumer Tech</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/technology/">Technology</a></p><p><b>Tags:</b> <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/keyboard/" rel="tag">Keyboard</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/open-ai/" rel="tag">Open AI</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/peripherals/" rel="tag">Peripherals</a></p>]]></description>
      <pubDate>Sat, 25 Jul 2026 04:03:00 GMT</pubDate>
      <guid>https://newatlas.com/computers/openai-codex-micro-keyboard/</guid>
      <dc:creator>Etiido Uko</dc:creator>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Harley's all-new motorcycle is going to divide opinions big time</title>
      <link>https://newatlas.com/motorcycles/harley-davidson-deadwood/</link>
      <description><![CDATA[<p><img src="https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/c7bce08/2147483647/strip/true/crop/2328x1310+0+0/resize/1440x810!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F7f%2Fa5%2F63c0fd894a79aa150e6ca3a977e6%2F2026-deadwood-lifestyle-ls-1.jpg" srcset="https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/711d265/2147483647/strip/true/crop/2328x1310+0+0/resize/440x248!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F7f%2Fa5%2F63c0fd894a79aa150e6ca3a977e6%2F2026-deadwood-lifestyle-ls-1.jpg 440w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/8379f1e/2147483647/strip/true/crop/2328x1310+0+0/resize/725x408!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F7f%2Fa5%2F63c0fd894a79aa150e6ca3a977e6%2F2026-deadwood-lifestyle-ls-1.jpg 725w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/2901cc5/2147483647/strip/true/crop/2328x1310+0+0/resize/800x450!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F7f%2Fa5%2F63c0fd894a79aa150e6ca3a977e6%2F2026-deadwood-lifestyle-ls-1.jpg 800w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/d0ec57f/2147483647/strip/true/crop/2328x1310+0+0/resize/1200x675!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F7f%2Fa5%2F63c0fd894a79aa150e6ca3a977e6%2F2026-deadwood-lifestyle-ls-1.jpg 1200w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/21ab25f/2147483647/strip/true/crop/2328x1310+0+0/resize/1920x1080!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F7f%2Fa5%2F63c0fd894a79aa150e6ca3a977e6%2F2026-deadwood-lifestyle-ls-1.jpg 1920w" alt="The Deadwood is a bit of a throwback to the post WWII-era" /><p>“Stripped back” – moto publications are screaming this term at the top of their lungs for Harley-Davidson’s latest release. And for good reason, too. Technically, it is very much a softail, but scratch the surface, and you’ll find a stripped-back bobber underneath.</p><p><a href="https://newatlas.com/motorcycles/harley-davidson-deadwood/">Continue Reading</a></p><p><b>Category:</b> <a href="https://newatlas.com/motorcycles/">Motorcycles</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/transport/">Transport</a></p><p><b>Tags:</b> <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/harley-davidson/" rel="tag">Harley Davidson</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/bobber/" rel="tag">Bobber</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/v-twin/" rel="tag">V-Twin</a></p>]]></description>
      <pubDate>Sat, 25 Jul 2026 01:03:00 GMT</pubDate>
      <guid>https://newatlas.com/motorcycles/harley-davidson-deadwood/</guid>
      <dc:creator>Utkarsh Sood</dc:creator>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Adorable Kia iCamper van loads up on adaptable versatility</title>
      <link>https://newatlas.com/campervans/wellhouse-kia-icamper-van/</link>
      <description><![CDATA[<p><img src="https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/993cecf/2147483647/strip/true/crop/1914x1365+0+0/resize/1346x960!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2Fd2%2F68%2Fcc746c1b4b73bd518779784b22f6%2F2026-05-28-08-04-56.jpg" srcset="https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/641e6a7/2147483647/strip/true/crop/1914x1365+0+0/resize/440x314!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2Fd2%2F68%2Fcc746c1b4b73bd518779784b22f6%2F2026-05-28-08-04-56.jpg 440w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/1505723/2147483647/strip/true/crop/1914x1365+0+0/resize/725x517!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2Fd2%2F68%2Fcc746c1b4b73bd518779784b22f6%2F2026-05-28-08-04-56.jpg 725w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/25c282d/2147483647/strip/true/crop/1914x1365+0+0/resize/800x571!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2Fd2%2F68%2Fcc746c1b4b73bd518779784b22f6%2F2026-05-28-08-04-56.jpg 800w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/eb2b2bd/2147483647/strip/true/crop/1914x1365+0+0/resize/1200x856!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2Fd2%2F68%2Fcc746c1b4b73bd518779784b22f6%2F2026-05-28-08-04-56.jpg 1200w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/c7400b6/2147483647/strip/true/crop/1914x1365+0+0/resize/1920x1369!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2Fd2%2F68%2Fcc746c1b4b73bd518779784b22f6%2F2026-05-28-08-04-56.jpg 1920w" alt="null" /><p>Coming off what might ultimately end up the world's cleanest Kia PV5 camper van conversion, we have yet another contender for "ultimate PV5 mini-camper van." Great Britain's Wellhouse Leisure is one of the world's preeminent crafters of both electric camper vans and tiny campers, so it's only natural it combines those talents to craft what appears to be the most versatile Kia PV5 mini-camper so far. Called the iCamper, the little battery-powered RV rearranges in ways that other PV5 e-campers don't, transitioning in mere seconds to support everything from solo bike camping getaways to full-on family holidays.</p><p><a href="https://newatlas.com/campervans/wellhouse-kia-icamper-van/">Continue Reading</a></p><p><b>Category:</b> <a href="https://newatlas.com/campervans/">Campervans</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/adventure-vehicles/">Adventure Vehicles</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/outdoors/">Outdoors</a></p><p><b>Tags:</b> <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/kia/" rel="tag">Kia</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/mini-campervan/" rel="tag">mini-campervan</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/rv/" rel="tag">RV</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/electric-camper/" rel="tag">electric-camper</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/wellhouse-leisure/" rel="tag">wellhouse-leisure</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/camping/" rel="tag">Camping</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/outdoor/" rel="tag">Outdoors and Camping</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/modular/" rel="tag">Modular</a></p>]]></description>
      <pubDate>Fri, 24 Jul 2026 23:03:00 GMT</pubDate>
      <guid>https://newatlas.com/campervans/wellhouse-kia-icamper-van/</guid>
      <dc:creator>C.C. Weiss</dc:creator>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Portable stove doubles as a camp furnace with cozy viewable flame</title>
      <link>https://newatlas.com/outdoor-cooking/pyronex-camping-stove-lantern-heater/</link>
      <description><![CDATA[<p><img src="https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/7f565d1/2147483647/strip/true/crop/2400x1600+0+0/resize/1440x960!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F57%2F6b%2Fb1c6177742989e9a443412d3399c%2F12.jpeg" srcset="https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/15b3073/2147483647/strip/true/crop/2400x1600+0+0/resize/440x293!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F57%2F6b%2Fb1c6177742989e9a443412d3399c%2F12.jpeg 440w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/517516b/2147483647/strip/true/crop/2400x1600+0+0/resize/725x483!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F57%2F6b%2Fb1c6177742989e9a443412d3399c%2F12.jpeg 725w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/363c6d7/2147483647/strip/true/crop/2400x1600+0+0/resize/800x533!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F57%2F6b%2Fb1c6177742989e9a443412d3399c%2F12.jpeg 800w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/747c165/2147483647/strip/true/crop/2400x1600+0+0/resize/1200x800!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F57%2F6b%2Fb1c6177742989e9a443412d3399c%2F12.jpeg 1200w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/c0d886c/2147483647/strip/true/crop/2400x1600+0+0/resize/1920x1280!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F57%2F6b%2Fb1c6177742989e9a443412d3399c%2F12.jpeg 1920w" alt="The Pyronex stove is presently on Kickstarter" /><p>Cooking outdoors is often the least relaxing part of camping, even for seasoned outdoor enthusiasts. Packing all the necessary gear, fuel, cookware, and trying to keep a flame alive in windy conditions can turn even a simple meal into quite a bit of work.</p><p><a href="https://newatlas.com/outdoor-cooking/pyronex-camping-stove-lantern-heater/">Continue Reading</a></p><p><b>Category:</b> <a href="https://newatlas.com/outdoor-cooking/">Outdoor Cooking</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/outdoor-gear/">Gear</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/outdoors/">Outdoors</a></p><p><b>Tags:</b> <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/xxkickbooster/" rel="tag">xxKickbooster</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/kickstarter/" rel="tag">Kickstarter</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/stove/" rel="tag">Stoves</a></p>]]></description>
      <pubDate>Fri, 24 Jul 2026 19:17:12 GMT</pubDate>
      <guid>https://newatlas.com/outdoor-cooking/pyronex-camping-stove-lantern-heater/</guid>
      <dc:creator>Maryna Holovnova</dc:creator>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>World's new tallest timber tower reaches incredible maximum height</title>
      <link>https://newatlas.com/architecture/atlassian-central-timber-tower-tops-out/</link>
      <description><![CDATA[<p><img src="https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/8c13917/2147483647/strip/true/crop/2048x1366+0+0/resize/1439x960!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2Fe3%2F0a%2F9ac697b64cef8c16438a523dafb2%2F260713-atlassiancentralprogress2-0137.jpg" srcset="https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/c4ba6e0/2147483647/strip/true/crop/2048x1366+0+0/resize/440x294!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2Fe3%2F0a%2F9ac697b64cef8c16438a523dafb2%2F260713-atlassiancentralprogress2-0137.jpg 440w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/8ca16c1/2147483647/strip/true/crop/2048x1366+0+0/resize/725x484!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2Fe3%2F0a%2F9ac697b64cef8c16438a523dafb2%2F260713-atlassiancentralprogress2-0137.jpg 725w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/30e8291/2147483647/strip/true/crop/2048x1366+0+0/resize/800x534!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2Fe3%2F0a%2F9ac697b64cef8c16438a523dafb2%2F260713-atlassiancentralprogress2-0137.jpg 800w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/74ae67b/2147483647/strip/true/crop/2048x1366+0+0/resize/1200x801!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2Fe3%2F0a%2F9ac697b64cef8c16438a523dafb2%2F260713-atlassiancentralprogress2-0137.jpg 1200w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/42443a5/2147483647/strip/true/crop/2048x1366+0+0/resize/1920x1281!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2Fe3%2F0a%2F9ac697b64cef8c16438a523dafb2%2F260713-atlassiancentralprogress2-0137.jpg 1920w" alt="Atlassian Central rises to a height of 180 m (591 ft), making it the world's tallest timber skyscraper" /><p>The world's new tallest hybrid timber skyscraper has officially topped out. Named Atlassian Central, the "plyscraper" soars to an incredible height of 180 m (591 ft), not just surpassing but smashing all previous records.</p><p><a href="https://newatlas.com/architecture/atlassian-central-timber-tower-tops-out/">Continue Reading</a></p><p><b>Category:</b> <a href="https://newatlas.com/architecture/">Architecture</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/engineering/">Engineering</a></p><p><b>Tags:</b> <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/building+and+construction/" rel="tag">Building and Construction</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/timber/" rel="tag">Timber</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/skyscrapers/" rel="tag">Skyscrapers</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/worlds-tallest/" rel="tag">World&apos;s Tallest</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/australia/" rel="tag">Australia</a></p>]]></description>
      <pubDate>Fri, 24 Jul 2026 12:57:00 GMT</pubDate>
      <guid>https://newatlas.com/architecture/atlassian-central-timber-tower-tops-out/</guid>
      <dc:creator>Adam Williams</dc:creator>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>RGB laser projector beams wall-filling 4K imagery from just inches away</title>
      <link>https://newatlas.com/home-entertainment/hisense-px4-pro-rgb-laser-4k-ust-projector/</link>
      <description><![CDATA[<p><img src="https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/be6ae2f/2147483647/strip/true/crop/1200x685+0+0/resize/1200x685!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F28%2Fb4%2Fd1300930471c8a21de6b5261ae25%2F01.jpg" srcset="https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/4286616/2147483647/strip/true/crop/1200x685+0+0/resize/440x251!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F28%2Fb4%2Fd1300930471c8a21de6b5261ae25%2F01.jpg 440w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/6ae5424/2147483647/strip/true/crop/1200x685+0+0/resize/725x414!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F28%2Fb4%2Fd1300930471c8a21de6b5261ae25%2F01.jpg 725w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/cf37a24/2147483647/strip/true/crop/1200x685+0+0/resize/800x457!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F28%2Fb4%2Fd1300930471c8a21de6b5261ae25%2F01.jpg 800w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/be6ae2f/2147483647/strip/true/crop/1200x685+0+0/resize/1200x685!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F28%2Fb4%2Fd1300930471c8a21de6b5261ae25%2F01.jpg 1200w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/c4aa532/2147483647/strip/true/crop/1200x685+0+0/resize/1920x1096!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F28%2Fb4%2Fd1300930471c8a21de6b5261ae25%2F01.jpg 1920w" alt="Positioned just inches from the wall or screen, the PX4 Pro projects massive, high-brightness 4K visuals" /><p>The appeal of an ultra-short-throw projector is pretty simple: you can get a huge image from a cabinet or sideboard nestled right up against a wall – without being troubled by ceiling mounts, long cable runs, or hardware sitting somewhere behind the couch.</p><p><a href="https://newatlas.com/home-entertainment/hisense-px4-pro-rgb-laser-4k-ust-projector/">Continue Reading</a></p><p><b>Category:</b> <a href="https://newatlas.com/home-entertainment/">Home Entertainment</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/consumer-tech/">Consumer Tech</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/technology/">Technology</a></p><p><b>Tags:</b> <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/hisense/" rel="tag">Hisense</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/projectors/" rel="tag">Projectors</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/laser-tv/" rel="tag">Laser TV</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/streaming/" rel="tag">Streaming</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/all-in-one/" rel="tag">All-in-one</a></p>]]></description>
      <pubDate>Fri, 24 Jul 2026 10:38:48 GMT</pubDate>
      <guid>https://newatlas.com/home-entertainment/hisense-px4-pro-rgb-laser-4k-ust-projector/</guid>
      <dc:creator>Monica J. White</dc:creator>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Peak Design introduces versatile quick-release camera bracket</title>
      <link>https://newatlas.com/photography/peak-field-bracket-camera-location-tracker/</link>
      <description><![CDATA[<p><img src="https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/7d154ae/2147483647/strip/true/crop/1200x800+0+0/resize/1200x800!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F46%2F77%2Ff72810a745dfb6c3fd1d2bb56a4d%2Fpeak-designs-field-bracket-makes-it-easy-to-connect-a-host-of-accessories-to-your-camera.jpg" srcset="https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/aeb2be1/2147483647/strip/true/crop/1200x800+0+0/resize/440x293!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F46%2F77%2Ff72810a745dfb6c3fd1d2bb56a4d%2Fpeak-designs-field-bracket-makes-it-easy-to-connect-a-host-of-accessories-to-your-camera.jpg 440w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/65cac0a/2147483647/strip/true/crop/1200x800+0+0/resize/725x483!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F46%2F77%2Ff72810a745dfb6c3fd1d2bb56a4d%2Fpeak-designs-field-bracket-makes-it-easy-to-connect-a-host-of-accessories-to-your-camera.jpg 725w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/820956d/2147483647/strip/true/crop/1200x800+0+0/resize/800x533!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F46%2F77%2Ff72810a745dfb6c3fd1d2bb56a4d%2Fpeak-designs-field-bracket-makes-it-easy-to-connect-a-host-of-accessories-to-your-camera.jpg 800w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/7d154ae/2147483647/strip/true/crop/1200x800+0+0/resize/1200x800!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F46%2F77%2Ff72810a745dfb6c3fd1d2bb56a4d%2Fpeak-designs-field-bracket-makes-it-easy-to-connect-a-host-of-accessories-to-your-camera.jpg 1200w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/514e71f/2147483647/strip/true/crop/1200x800+0+0/resize/1920x1280!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F46%2F77%2Ff72810a745dfb6c3fd1d2bb56a4d%2Fpeak-designs-field-bracket-makes-it-easy-to-connect-a-host-of-accessories-to-your-camera.jpg 1920w" alt="Peak Design's Field Bracket makes it easy to connect a host of accessories to your camera" /><p>Peak Design already makes a range of well-loved camera accessories, and it's now expanding its lineup with the Field Bracket. It's designed for folks who use their gear in many different scenarios, and could use a mounting system that'll keep up.</p><p><a href="https://newatlas.com/photography/peak-field-bracket-camera-location-tracker/">Continue Reading</a></p><p><b>Category:</b> <a href="https://newatlas.com/photography/">Photography</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/consumer-tech/">Consumer Tech</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/technology/">Technology</a></p><p><b>Tags:</b> <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/cameras/" rel="tag">Cameras</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/peak-design/" rel="tag">Peak Design</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/kickstarter/" rel="tag">Kickstarter</a></p>]]></description>
      <pubDate>Fri, 24 Jul 2026 04:46:36 GMT</pubDate>
      <guid>https://newatlas.com/photography/peak-field-bracket-camera-location-tracker/</guid>
      <dc:creator>Abhimanyu Ghoshal</dc:creator>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Mini packs all the essentials into a towable tiny house</title>
      <link>https://newatlas.com/tiny-houses/mini-craft-house/</link>
      <description><![CDATA[<p><img src="https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/8dd45b5/2147483647/strip/true/crop/3200x1800+0+0/resize/1440x810!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F80%2F49%2F07091462443ca120810f839c449d%2Fmini-tiny-house-4.png" srcset="https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/ae035a7/2147483647/strip/true/crop/3200x1800+0+0/resize/440x248!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F80%2F49%2F07091462443ca120810f839c449d%2Fmini-tiny-house-4.png 440w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/ab5d96a/2147483647/strip/true/crop/3200x1800+0+0/resize/725x408!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F80%2F49%2F07091462443ca120810f839c449d%2Fmini-tiny-house-4.png 725w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/34d0f9d/2147483647/strip/true/crop/3200x1800+0+0/resize/800x450!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F80%2F49%2F07091462443ca120810f839c449d%2Fmini-tiny-house-4.png 800w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/5298cc2/2147483647/strip/true/crop/3200x1800+0+0/resize/1200x675!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F80%2F49%2F07091462443ca120810f839c449d%2Fmini-tiny-house-4.png 1200w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/30c8e50/2147483647/strip/true/crop/3200x1800+0+0/resize/1920x1080!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F80%2F49%2F07091462443ca120810f839c449d%2Fmini-tiny-house-4.png 1920w" alt="The Mini, by Craft House, fits everything needed for two people into its modest towable footprint" /><p>With its modest length of just 6 m (20 ft), the Mini tiny house could be a good fit for would-be nomads. The home combines its compact dimensions with a well-designed layout that has everything needed for up to two people to downsize comfortably.</p><p><a href="https://newatlas.com/tiny-houses/mini-craft-house/">Continue Reading</a></p><p><b>Category:</b> <a href="https://newatlas.com/tiny-houses/">Tiny Houses</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/outdoors/">Outdoors</a></p><p><b>Tags:</b> <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/building+and+construction/" rel="tag">Building and Construction</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/tiny-footprint/" rel="tag">Tiny Footprint</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/micro-housing/" rel="tag">Micro-House</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/danish-mirror-house/21118/" rel="tag">House</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/home/" rel="tag">Home</a></p>]]></description>
      <pubDate>Fri, 24 Jul 2026 04:24:47 GMT</pubDate>
      <guid>https://newatlas.com/tiny-houses/mini-craft-house/</guid>
      <dc:creator>Adam Williams</dc:creator>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Better skyscraper "shocks" hinge on cheap, abundant material</title>
      <link>https://newatlas.com/engineering/building-dampers-sand/</link>
      <description><![CDATA[<p><img src="https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/1c95b21/2147483647/strip/true/crop/5000x3337+0+0/resize/1438x960!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F5f%2F8c%2Fd2778857495bb4d1621dd6e23345%2Fdepositphotos-39516761-xl.jpg" srcset="https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/6d444b9/2147483647/strip/true/crop/5000x3337+0+0/resize/440x294!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F5f%2F8c%2Fd2778857495bb4d1621dd6e23345%2Fdepositphotos-39516761-xl.jpg 440w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/585cfb5/2147483647/strip/true/crop/5000x3337+0+0/resize/725x484!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F5f%2F8c%2Fd2778857495bb4d1621dd6e23345%2Fdepositphotos-39516761-xl.jpg 725w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/2d9cc78/2147483647/strip/true/crop/5000x3337+0+0/resize/800x534!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F5f%2F8c%2Fd2778857495bb4d1621dd6e23345%2Fdepositphotos-39516761-xl.jpg 800w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/9000c8b/2147483647/strip/true/crop/5000x3337+0+0/resize/1200x801!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F5f%2F8c%2Fd2778857495bb4d1621dd6e23345%2Fdepositphotos-39516761-xl.jpg 1200w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/22830e8/2147483647/strip/true/crop/5000x3337+0+0/resize/1920x1282!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F5f%2F8c%2Fd2778857495bb4d1621dd6e23345%2Fdepositphotos-39516761-xl.jpg 1920w" alt="A conventional hydraulic tuned mass damper – it may look impressive, but a sand damper could keep buildings from swaying much more efficiently" /><p>If you simply love trying to work in an office tower or live in a skyrise while constantly fighting the urge to barf or have your brain explode from stress, then you probably hate dampers.</p><p><a href="https://newatlas.com/engineering/building-dampers-sand/">Continue Reading</a></p><p><b>Category:</b> <a href="https://newatlas.com/engineering/">Engineering</a></p><p><b>Tags:</b> <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/university-of-mississippi/" rel="tag">University of Mississippi</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/building+and+construction/" rel="tag">Building and Construction</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/suspension/" rel="tag">Suspension</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/earthquake/" rel="tag">Earthquake</a></p>]]></description>
      <pubDate>Fri, 24 Jul 2026 02:17:36 GMT</pubDate>
      <guid>https://newatlas.com/engineering/building-dampers-sand/</guid>
      <dc:creator>Malcolm Azania</dc:creator>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Sinkholes saved these endangered trees – then trapped them there</title>
      <link>https://newatlas.com/environment/sinkholes-evolutionary-trap-undermine-survival/</link>
      <description><![CDATA[<p><img src="https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/4c2fc4d/2147483647/strip/true/crop/6720x4480+0+0/resize/1440x960!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F36%2F50%2Fcae909a947b98a1e985494ebf4e1%2Fdepositphotos-417532108-xl.jpg" srcset="https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/9d6bd67/2147483647/strip/true/crop/6720x4480+0+0/resize/440x293!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F36%2F50%2Fcae909a947b98a1e985494ebf4e1%2Fdepositphotos-417532108-xl.jpg 440w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/ab74c4c/2147483647/strip/true/crop/6720x4480+0+0/resize/725x483!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F36%2F50%2Fcae909a947b98a1e985494ebf4e1%2Fdepositphotos-417532108-xl.jpg 725w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/e17e905/2147483647/strip/true/crop/6720x4480+0+0/resize/800x533!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F36%2F50%2Fcae909a947b98a1e985494ebf4e1%2Fdepositphotos-417532108-xl.jpg 800w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/2b87ce6/2147483647/strip/true/crop/6720x4480+0+0/resize/1200x800!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F36%2F50%2Fcae909a947b98a1e985494ebf4e1%2Fdepositphotos-417532108-xl.jpg 1200w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/c784ceb/2147483647/strip/true/crop/6720x4480+0+0/resize/1920x1280!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F36%2F50%2Fcae909a947b98a1e985494ebf4e1%2Fdepositphotos-417532108-xl.jpg 1920w" alt="Karst tiankengs – or giant enclosed sinkholes – harbor humid, shaded plant species that may buffer present-day climate stress yet reduce long-term resilience" /><p>Large sinkholes in nature have traditionally been viewed as a win for biodiversity, protecting plants that would be exposed to environmental stress above ground. However, a new genetic study indicates they are an evolutionary death trap.</p><p><a href="https://newatlas.com/environment/sinkholes-evolutionary-trap-undermine-survival/">Continue Reading</a></p><p><b>Category:</b> <a href="https://refractor.io/environment/">Environment</a>, <a href="https://refractor.io/science/">Science</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/rf/">Refractor: Science &amp; Health</a></p><p><b>Tags:</b> <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/chinese-academy-of-sciences/" rel="tag">Chinese Academy of Sciences</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/biodiversity/" rel="tag">Biodiversity</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/tree/" rel="tag">Tree</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/light/" rel="tag">Light</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/photosynthesis/" rel="tag">Photosynthesis</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/carbon-capture/" rel="tag">Carbon capture</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/adaptive/" rel="tag">adaptive</a></p>]]></description>
      <pubDate>Fri, 24 Jul 2026 00:41:42 GMT</pubDate>
      <guid>https://newatlas.com/environment/sinkholes-evolutionary-trap-undermine-survival/</guid>
      <dc:creator>Bronwyn Thompson</dc:creator>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Norse Foldable camp tool packs in a surprise flip-out blade</title>
      <link>https://newatlas.com/knives-multitools/norse-foldable-pocket-ax/</link>
      <description><![CDATA[<p><img src="https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/be18dc3/2147483647/strip/true/crop/2595x1946+0+0/resize/1280x960!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F16%2Fc1%2F01f11aa94c20bd296cd6a93e43dc%2F03-norse-foldableaxe-willumsen-grade-1.jpg" srcset="https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/31a69ad/2147483647/strip/true/crop/2595x1946+0+0/resize/440x330!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F16%2Fc1%2F01f11aa94c20bd296cd6a93e43dc%2F03-norse-foldableaxe-willumsen-grade-1.jpg 440w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/5c9ed37/2147483647/strip/true/crop/2595x1946+0+0/resize/725x544!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F16%2Fc1%2F01f11aa94c20bd296cd6a93e43dc%2F03-norse-foldableaxe-willumsen-grade-1.jpg 725w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/17164c4/2147483647/strip/true/crop/2595x1946+0+0/resize/800x600!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F16%2Fc1%2F01f11aa94c20bd296cd6a93e43dc%2F03-norse-foldableaxe-willumsen-grade-1.jpg 800w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/2967e1d/2147483647/strip/true/crop/2595x1946+0+0/resize/1200x900!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F16%2Fc1%2F01f11aa94c20bd296cd6a93e43dc%2F03-norse-foldableaxe-willumsen-grade-1.jpg 1200w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/cf714ca/2147483647/strip/true/crop/2595x1946+0+0/resize/1920x1440!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F16%2Fc1%2F01f11aa94c20bd296cd6a93e43dc%2F03-norse-foldableaxe-willumsen-grade-1.jpg 1920w" alt="A different kind of folding blade tool" /><p>We're so used to seeing folding knives (and folding blade-loaded multitools) during our daily travels around world and web, we're not quite ready for an entirely different tool inside a folding package, especially not one with very knife-like G10 scales and thumbhole. But the all-new Norse Foldable from Willumsen conceals a different fold-out blade inside its handle. It does look just a bit too chunky when closed to be a knife, and that hints at the real capability that flips open in milliseconds at the flick of a wrist.</p><p><a href="https://newatlas.com/knives-multitools/norse-foldable-pocket-ax/">Continue Reading</a></p><p><b>Category:</b> <a href="https://newatlas.com/knives-multitools/">Knives and Multitools</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/outdoor-gear/">Gear</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/outdoors/">Outdoors</a></p><p><b>Tags:</b> <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/ax/" rel="tag">Axes</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/kickstarter/" rel="tag">Kickstarter</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/foldable/" rel="tag">Foldable</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/camping/" rel="tag">Camping</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/backpacking/" rel="tag">Backpacking</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/bikepacking/" rel="tag">Bikepacking</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/outdoor/" rel="tag">Outdoors and Camping</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/tools/" rel="tag">Tools</a></p>]]></description>
      <pubDate>Thu, 23 Jul 2026 20:43:00 GMT</pubDate>
      <guid>https://newatlas.com/knives-multitools/norse-foldable-pocket-ax/</guid>
      <dc:creator>C.C. Weiss</dc:creator>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>In photos: High-flying insanity at the 2026 Farnborough Air Show</title>
      <link>https://newatlas.com/aircraft/new-atlas-farnborough-2026/</link>
      <description><![CDATA[<p><img src="https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/b578a0e/2147483647/strip/true/crop/1338x896+0+0/resize/1338x896!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F99%2Fb8%2F2c2c932e48a39a439dfdb9232201%2Fscreenshot-2026-07-23-151552.png" srcset="https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/f9b2019/2147483647/strip/true/crop/1338x896+0+0/resize/440x295!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F99%2Fb8%2F2c2c932e48a39a439dfdb9232201%2Fscreenshot-2026-07-23-151552.png 440w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/f77e674/2147483647/strip/true/crop/1338x896+0+0/resize/725x486!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F99%2Fb8%2F2c2c932e48a39a439dfdb9232201%2Fscreenshot-2026-07-23-151552.png 725w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/c09ed6c/2147483647/strip/true/crop/1338x896+0+0/resize/800x536!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F99%2Fb8%2F2c2c932e48a39a439dfdb9232201%2Fscreenshot-2026-07-23-151552.png 800w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/4849561/2147483647/strip/true/crop/1338x896+0+0/resize/1200x804!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F99%2Fb8%2F2c2c932e48a39a439dfdb9232201%2Fscreenshot-2026-07-23-151552.png 1200w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/0badae1/2147483647/strip/true/crop/1338x896+0+0/resize/1920x1286!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F99%2Fb8%2F2c2c932e48a39a439dfdb9232201%2Fscreenshot-2026-07-23-151552.png 1920w" alt="Airbus A400M operated by the RAF" /><p>The Farnborough International Airshow in the UK is one of the world's premier aerospace events, where major industry announcements and billion-dollar deals are as common as muffins. New Atlas is on the ground at this year's record-breaking event.</p><p><a href="https://newatlas.com/aircraft/new-atlas-farnborough-2026/">Continue Reading</a></p><p><b>Category:</b> <a href="https://newatlas.com/aircraft/">Aircraft</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/transport/">Transport</a></p><p><b>Tags:</b> <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/aircraft/" rel="tag">Aircraft</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/show/" rel="tag">Show</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/farnborough-airshow/" rel="tag">Farnborough Airshow</a></p>]]></description>
      <pubDate>Thu, 23 Jul 2026 16:23:46 GMT</pubDate>
      <guid>https://newatlas.com/aircraft/new-atlas-farnborough-2026/</guid>
      <dc:creator>David Szondy</dc:creator>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>More testosterone won’t make a better soldier or a tougher man</title>
      <link>https://refractor.io/health-wellbeing/testosterone-soldier-tougher-man/</link>
      <description><![CDATA[<p><img src="https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/7d473cc/2147483647/strip/true/crop/7360x4912+0+0/resize/1438x960!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F68%2F57%2F5c7dfaaf4a65838c5bceba70b231%2Fdepositphotos-253935660-xl.jpg" srcset="https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/c347d2c/2147483647/strip/true/crop/7360x4912+0+0/resize/440x294!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F68%2F57%2F5c7dfaaf4a65838c5bceba70b231%2Fdepositphotos-253935660-xl.jpg 440w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/5dba8c8/2147483647/strip/true/crop/7360x4912+0+0/resize/725x484!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F68%2F57%2F5c7dfaaf4a65838c5bceba70b231%2Fdepositphotos-253935660-xl.jpg 725w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/de570b0/2147483647/strip/true/crop/7360x4912+0+0/resize/800x534!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F68%2F57%2F5c7dfaaf4a65838c5bceba70b231%2Fdepositphotos-253935660-xl.jpg 800w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/3b0fa10/2147483647/strip/true/crop/7360x4912+0+0/resize/1200x801!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F68%2F57%2F5c7dfaaf4a65838c5bceba70b231%2Fdepositphotos-253935660-xl.jpg 1200w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/8356cc4/2147483647/strip/true/crop/7360x4912+0+0/resize/1920x1282!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F68%2F57%2F5c7dfaaf4a65838c5bceba70b231%2Fdepositphotos-253935660-xl.jpg 1920w" alt="Scientists debunk the myths around the "power" of testosterone" /><p>Adam Stanaland, University of Richmond/The Conversation</p><p><a href="https://refractor.io/health-wellbeing/testosterone-soldier-tougher-man/">Continue Reading</a></p><p><b>Category:</b> <a href="https://refractor.io/health-wellbeing/">Wellness and Healthy Living</a>, <a href="https://refractor.io/medical/">Body and Mind</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/rf/">Refractor: Science &amp; Health</a></p><p><b>Tags:</b> <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/testosterone/" rel="tag">Testosterone</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/hormone/" rel="tag">Hormones</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/behavior/" rel="tag">Behavior</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/physical-functioning/" rel="tag">Physical functioning</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/army/" rel="tag">Army</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/warfare/" rel="tag">Warfare</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/battlefield/" rel="tag">Battlefield</a></p>]]></description>
