    <item>
      <title>MORFIUS counter-drone hunts hostile drones with microwaves</title>
      <link>https://newatlas.com/military/morfius-counter-drone-microwaves/</link>
      <description><![CDATA[<p><img src="https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/672dc1f/2147483647/strip/true/crop/1500x1308+0+0/resize/1101x960!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F10%2Fcb%2F4c0168bb46e185423a4bd6747a6b%2Fmorfius-2.jpg" srcset="https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/b001631/2147483647/strip/true/crop/1500x1308+0+0/resize/440x384!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F10%2Fcb%2F4c0168bb46e185423a4bd6747a6b%2Fmorfius-2.jpg 440w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/98e427e/2147483647/strip/true/crop/1500x1308+0+0/resize/725x632!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F10%2Fcb%2F4c0168bb46e185423a4bd6747a6b%2Fmorfius-2.jpg 725w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/2f05fee/2147483647/strip/true/crop/1500x1308+0+0/resize/800x698!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F10%2Fcb%2F4c0168bb46e185423a4bd6747a6b%2Fmorfius-2.jpg 800w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/4434f03/2147483647/strip/true/crop/1500x1308+0+0/resize/1200x1046!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F10%2Fcb%2F4c0168bb46e185423a4bd6747a6b%2Fmorfius-2.jpg 1200w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/d0af547/2147483647/strip/true/crop/1500x1308+0+0/resize/1920x1674!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F10%2Fcb%2F4c0168bb46e185423a4bd6747a6b%2Fmorfius-2.jpg 1920w" alt="MORFIUS" /><p>As F-35 fighters roared overhead in display, Lockheed Martin unveiled its MORFIUS counter-drone at this year's Farnborough International Airshow. It uses a directed energy weapon to take out over 50 hostile drones per flight.</p><p><a href="https://newatlas.com/military/morfius-counter-drone-microwaves/">Continue Reading</a></p><p><b>Category:</b> <a href="https://newatlas.com/military/">Military</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/engineering/">Engineering</a></p><p><b>Tags:</b> <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/directed-energy-weapon/" rel="tag">Directed Energy Weapon</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/drones/" rel="tag">drones</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/lockheed+martin/" rel="tag">Lockheed Martin</a></p>]]></description>
      <pubDate>Thu, 23 Jul 2026 12:37:47 GMT</pubDate>
      <guid>https://newatlas.com/military/morfius-counter-drone-microwaves/</guid>
      <dc:creator>David Szondy</dc:creator>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Microbe can turn into a "supergiant" cannibal (and we're not sure why)</title>
      <link>https://newatlas.com/biology/microbe-can-turn-into-a-supergiant-cannibal-and-were-not-sure-why/</link>
      <description><![CDATA[<p><img src="https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/2b7b3dd/2147483647/strip/true/crop/2000x1500+0+0/resize/1280x960!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F82%2F8e%2F0d3b884543db8a753fa4e97f6498%2Fgiant-cannibal-microbe.jpg" srcset="https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/54aa06a/2147483647/strip/true/crop/2000x1500+0+0/resize/440x330!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F82%2F8e%2F0d3b884543db8a753fa4e97f6498%2Fgiant-cannibal-microbe.jpg 440w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/f944d94/2147483647/strip/true/crop/2000x1500+0+0/resize/725x544!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F82%2F8e%2F0d3b884543db8a753fa4e97f6498%2Fgiant-cannibal-microbe.jpg 725w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/ba479dd/2147483647/strip/true/crop/2000x1500+0+0/resize/800x600!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F82%2F8e%2F0d3b884543db8a753fa4e97f6498%2Fgiant-cannibal-microbe.jpg 800w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/d48520d/2147483647/strip/true/crop/2000x1500+0+0/resize/1200x900!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F82%2F8e%2F0d3b884543db8a753fa4e97f6498%2Fgiant-cannibal-microbe.jpg 1200w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/f70a9ae/2147483647/strip/true/crop/2000x1500+0+0/resize/1920x1440!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F82%2F8e%2F0d3b884543db8a753fa4e97f6498%2Fgiant-cannibal-microbe.jpg 1920w" alt="Euplotes gigatrox" /><p>In cloned populations of a newly described single-celled protist, a few cells undergo a voracious transformation. They metamorphose into much larger “supergiants” that shift their shape, alter their movement, and begin hunting and eating their own genetically identical relatives.</p><p><a href="https://newatlas.com/biology/microbe-can-turn-into-a-supergiant-cannibal-and-were-not-sure-why/">Continue Reading</a></p><p><b>Category:</b> <a href="https://refractor.io/biology/">Biology</a>, <a href="https://refractor.io/science/">Science</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/rf/">Refractor: Science &amp; Health</a></p><p><b>Tags:</b> <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/micro-organism/" rel="tag">Micro-organisms</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/hunting/" rel="tag">Hunting</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/cells/" rel="tag">Cells</a>, <a href="https://refractor.io/tag/protist/" rel="tag">protist</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/transformable/" rel="tag">Transformable</a></p>]]></description>
      <pubDate>Thu, 23 Jul 2026 10:09:53 GMT</pubDate>
      <guid>https://newatlas.com/biology/microbe-can-turn-into-a-supergiant-cannibal-and-were-not-sure-why/</guid>
      <dc:creator>Jay Kakade</dc:creator>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Tiny knife is actually a multitool with a few extra functions</title>
      <link>https://newatlas.com/knives-multitools/edge-pop-dual-damascus-knife-edc-multitool/</link>
      <description><![CDATA[<p><img src="https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/205b97c/2147483647/strip/true/crop/1200x895+0+0/resize/1200x895!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F0d%2F8f%2Fb00d7c5e4b5fb899c571befdf092%2Fthe-sharp-damascus-steel-blade-can-easily-slice-through-paper-leather-and-rope.jpg" srcset="https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/90b07c3/2147483647/strip/true/crop/1200x895+0+0/resize/440x328!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F0d%2F8f%2Fb00d7c5e4b5fb899c571befdf092%2Fthe-sharp-damascus-steel-blade-can-easily-slice-through-paper-leather-and-rope.jpg 440w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/b5ee755/2147483647/strip/true/crop/1200x895+0+0/resize/725x541!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F0d%2F8f%2Fb00d7c5e4b5fb899c571befdf092%2Fthe-sharp-damascus-steel-blade-can-easily-slice-through-paper-leather-and-rope.jpg 725w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/4c70115/2147483647/strip/true/crop/1200x895+0+0/resize/800x597!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F0d%2F8f%2Fb00d7c5e4b5fb899c571befdf092%2Fthe-sharp-damascus-steel-blade-can-easily-slice-through-paper-leather-and-rope.jpg 800w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/205b97c/2147483647/strip/true/crop/1200x895+0+0/resize/1200x895!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F0d%2F8f%2Fb00d7c5e4b5fb899c571befdf092%2Fthe-sharp-damascus-steel-blade-can-easily-slice-through-paper-leather-and-rope.jpg 1200w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/ed9e877/2147483647/strip/true/crop/1200x895+0+0/resize/1920x1432!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F0d%2F8f%2Fb00d7c5e4b5fb899c571befdf092%2Fthe-sharp-damascus-steel-blade-can-easily-slice-through-paper-leather-and-rope.jpg 1920w" alt="The sharp Damascus steel blade can easily slice through paper, leather, and rope" /><p>I love a multitool as much as the next person, but some of them really aim to do too much for my liking – especially when I'm within city limits.</p><p><a href="https://newatlas.com/knives-multitools/edge-pop-dual-damascus-knife-edc-multitool/">Continue Reading</a></p><p><b>Category:</b> <a href="https://newatlas.com/knives-multitools/">Knives and Multitools</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/outdoor-gear/">Gear</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/outdoors/">Outdoors</a></p><p><b>Tags:</b> <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/knife/" rel="tag">Knife</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/edc/" rel="tag">EDC</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/tools/" rel="tag">Tools</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/kickstarter/" rel="tag">Kickstarter</a></p>]]></description>
      <pubDate>Thu, 23 Jul 2026 09:52:45 GMT</pubDate>
      <guid>https://newatlas.com/knives-multitools/edge-pop-dual-damascus-knife-edc-multitool/</guid>
      <dc:creator>Abhimanyu Ghoshal</dc:creator>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Daylight saving could affect your risk of developing eye disease</title>
      <link>https://newatlas.com/sleep/daylight-saving-eye-disease/</link>
      <description><![CDATA[<p><img src="https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/71c620b/2147483647/strip/true/crop/2000x1500+0+0/resize/1280x960!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F57%2Fa2%2F432d2f304550aa0eae9de348ff57%2Fdark-coloured-iris.jpg" srcset="https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/3621a6f/2147483647/strip/true/crop/2000x1500+0+0/resize/440x330!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F57%2Fa2%2F432d2f304550aa0eae9de348ff57%2Fdark-coloured-iris.jpg 440w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/d7d48f8/2147483647/strip/true/crop/2000x1500+0+0/resize/725x544!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F57%2Fa2%2F432d2f304550aa0eae9de348ff57%2Fdark-coloured-iris.jpg 725w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/69532c1/2147483647/strip/true/crop/2000x1500+0+0/resize/800x600!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F57%2Fa2%2F432d2f304550aa0eae9de348ff57%2Fdark-coloured-iris.jpg 800w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/f049c28/2147483647/strip/true/crop/2000x1500+0+0/resize/1200x900!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F57%2Fa2%2F432d2f304550aa0eae9de348ff57%2Fdark-coloured-iris.jpg 1200w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/240e826/2147483647/strip/true/crop/2000x1500+0+0/resize/1920x1440!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F57%2Fa2%2F432d2f304550aa0eae9de348ff57%2Fdark-coloured-iris.jpg 1920w" alt="Iris up close" /><p>While daylight saving may give us a little extra sunshine at the end of our workdays, the transition may be costing us our health.</p><p><a href="https://newatlas.com/sleep/daylight-saving-eye-disease/">Continue Reading</a></p><p><b>Category:</b> <a href="https://refractor.io/sleep/">Sleep</a>, <a href="https://refractor.io/health-wellbeing/">Wellness and Healthy Living</a>, <a href="https://refractor.io/medical/">Body and Mind</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/rf/">Refractor: Science &amp; Health</a></p><p><b>Tags:</b> <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/sleep/" rel="tag">Sleep</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/eye-diseases/" rel="tag">Eye diseases</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/retina/" rel="tag">Retina</a>, <a href="https://refractor.io/tag/daylight-saving-time/" rel="tag">daylight-saving-time</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/macular-degeneration/" rel="tag">Macular Degeneration</a></p>]]></description>
      <pubDate>Thu, 23 Jul 2026 05:14:33 GMT</pubDate>
      <guid>https://newatlas.com/sleep/daylight-saving-eye-disease/</guid>
      <dc:creator>Mike McRae</dc:creator>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Lockheed Martin debuts budget-friendly PAC-3 ACE interceptor</title>
      <link>https://newatlas.com/military/lockheed-martin-patriot-advanced-capability-3-adapted-capability-effector/</link>
      <description><![CDATA[<p><img src="https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/b801d11/2147483647/strip/true/crop/1200x676+0+0/resize/1200x676!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F41%2F97%2F84a8c2634f32931274626101be99%2Fpac-3-ace.jpg" srcset="https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/0d1029f/2147483647/strip/true/crop/1200x676+0+0/resize/440x248!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F41%2F97%2F84a8c2634f32931274626101be99%2Fpac-3-ace.jpg 440w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/88a6e2f/2147483647/strip/true/crop/1200x676+0+0/resize/725x408!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F41%2F97%2F84a8c2634f32931274626101be99%2Fpac-3-ace.jpg 725w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/430ab12/2147483647/strip/true/crop/1200x676+0+0/resize/800x451!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F41%2F97%2F84a8c2634f32931274626101be99%2Fpac-3-ace.jpg 800w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/b801d11/2147483647/strip/true/crop/1200x676+0+0/resize/1200x676!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F41%2F97%2F84a8c2634f32931274626101be99%2Fpac-3-ace.jpg 1200w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/9273938/2147483647/strip/true/crop/1200x676+0+0/resize/1920x1082!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F41%2F97%2F84a8c2634f32931274626101be99%2Fpac-3-ace.jpg 1920w" alt="Artist's concept of the PAC-3 ACE interceptor missile" /><p>Lockheed Martin used this year's Farnborough International Airshow to introduce a low-cost alternative to its Patriot surface-to-air interceptor missile called the Patriot Advanced Capability-3 Adapted Capability Effector (PAC-3 ACE).</p><p><a href="https://newatlas.com/military/lockheed-martin-patriot-advanced-capability-3-adapted-capability-effector/">Continue Reading</a></p><p><b>Category:</b> <a href="https://newatlas.com/military/">Military</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/engineering/">Engineering</a></p><p><b>Tags:</b> <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/lockheed+martin/" rel="tag">Lockheed Martin</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/missile-defense/" rel="tag">Missile Defense</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/farnborough-airshow/" rel="tag">Farnborough Airshow</a></p>]]></description>
      <pubDate>Thu, 23 Jul 2026 03:49:49 GMT</pubDate>
      <guid>https://newatlas.com/military/lockheed-martin-patriot-advanced-capability-3-adapted-capability-effector/</guid>
      <dc:creator>David Szondy</dc:creator>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>More men are getting 'the snip' and cite the rising cost of living for decision</title>
      <link>https://refractor.io/biology/men-the-snip-economic-pressure/</link>
      <description><![CDATA[<p><img src="https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/79b95bd/2147483647/strip/true/crop/5416x3611+0+0/resize/1440x960!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2Ffb%2F33%2F5454f1a34f7d9bfb9d5fd5651439%2Fdepositphotos-464520672-xl.jpg" srcset="https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/3bd2610/2147483647/strip/true/crop/5416x3611+0+0/resize/440x293!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2Ffb%2F33%2F5454f1a34f7d9bfb9d5fd5651439%2Fdepositphotos-464520672-xl.jpg 440w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/e4cf2da/2147483647/strip/true/crop/5416x3611+0+0/resize/725x483!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2Ffb%2F33%2F5454f1a34f7d9bfb9d5fd5651439%2Fdepositphotos-464520672-xl.jpg 725w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/1c0ce9f/2147483647/strip/true/crop/5416x3611+0+0/resize/800x533!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2Ffb%2F33%2F5454f1a34f7d9bfb9d5fd5651439%2Fdepositphotos-464520672-xl.jpg 800w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/e70a63b/2147483647/strip/true/crop/5416x3611+0+0/resize/1200x800!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2Ffb%2F33%2F5454f1a34f7d9bfb9d5fd5651439%2Fdepositphotos-464520672-xl.jpg 1200w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/2367ec4/2147483647/strip/true/crop/5416x3611+0+0/resize/1920x1280!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2Ffb%2F33%2F5454f1a34f7d9bfb9d5fd5651439%2Fdepositphotos-464520672-xl.jpg 1920w" alt="Aussie men are choosing the procedure in growing numbers" /><p>While cost-of-living pressures continue to impact consumer behavior, one business appears to be booming: the vasectomy industry.</p><p><a href="https://refractor.io/biology/men-the-snip-economic-pressure/">Continue Reading</a></p><p><b>Category:</b> <a href="https://refractor.io/biology/">Biology</a>, <a href="https://refractor.io/science/">Science</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/rf/">Refractor: Science &amp; Health</a></p><p><b>Tags:</b> <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/male-contraceptive/" rel="tag">Male Contraceptives</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/contraception/" rel="tag">Contraception</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/society/" rel="tag">Society</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/reproduction/" rel="tag">Reproduction</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/birth-control/" rel="tag">Birth Control</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/aging-population/" rel="tag">Aging population</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/surgery/" rel="tag">Surgery</a></p>]]></description>
      <pubDate>Thu, 23 Jul 2026 01:12:41 GMT</pubDate>
      <guid>https://refractor.io/biology/men-the-snip-economic-pressure/</guid>
      <dc:creator>Bronwyn Thompson</dc:creator>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Panoramic motorized PHEV camping trailer axes smart RV pricing</title>
      <link>https://newatlas.com/camping-trailers/aboard-t4-self-driving-travel-trailer/</link>
      <description><![CDATA[<p><img src="https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/dec2942/2147483647/strip/true/crop/2231x1977+0+0/resize/1083x960!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F0b%2F5d%2F86f8b32449c895f35434311d37d7%2F710573052-17874100605655502-7973567085908324086-n.jpg" srcset="https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/b8a6ac5/2147483647/strip/true/crop/2231x1977+0+0/resize/440x390!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F0b%2F5d%2F86f8b32449c895f35434311d37d7%2F710573052-17874100605655502-7973567085908324086-n.jpg 440w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/2e801a4/2147483647/strip/true/crop/2231x1977+0+0/resize/725x643!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F0b%2F5d%2F86f8b32449c895f35434311d37d7%2F710573052-17874100605655502-7973567085908324086-n.jpg 725w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/4cdc12f/2147483647/strip/true/crop/2231x1977+0+0/resize/800x709!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F0b%2F5d%2F86f8b32449c895f35434311d37d7%2F710573052-17874100605655502-7973567085908324086-n.jpg 800w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/89869cb/2147483647/strip/true/crop/2231x1977+0+0/resize/1200x1064!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F0b%2F5d%2F86f8b32449c895f35434311d37d7%2F710573052-17874100605655502-7973567085908324086-n.jpg 1200w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/7be9adb/2147483647/strip/true/crop/2231x1977+0+0/resize/1920x1702!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F0b%2F5d%2F86f8b32449c895f35434311d37d7%2F710573052-17874100605655502-7973567085908324086-n.jpg 1920w" alt="The white-and-black Aboard T4 trailer definitely stands out more than the all-black version" /><p>For at least three years now, Silicon Valley and its global tech-futurist counterparts have been crafting a new vision for the future of RVing: long, sleek, luxurious glamping trailers that deliver their own motive power, sensor-based assistance and smart home conveniences. That vision invariably includes one other characteristic: a six-figure price tag. But the new T4 trailer from Southern California startup Aboard Mobility looks to squeeze all the high-tech convenience and glamping comfort into a much smaller base price. Whether Aboard is successful at doing so remains to be seen.</p><p><a href="https://newatlas.com/camping-trailers/aboard-t4-self-driving-travel-trailer/">Continue Reading</a></p><p><b>Category:</b> <a href="https://newatlas.com/camping-trailers/">Camping Trailers</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/adventure-vehicles/">Adventure Vehicles</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/outdoors/">Outdoors</a></p><p><b>Tags:</b> <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/caravan/" rel="tag">Caravan</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/electric-camper/" rel="tag">electric-camper</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/smart-rv/" rel="tag">smart RV</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/trailers/" rel="tag">trailers</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/trailer/" rel="tag">Trailer</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/rv/" rel="tag">RV</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/self-driving/" rel="tag">Self-Driving</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/outdoor/" rel="tag">Outdoors and Camping</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/glamping/" rel="tag">Glamping</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/camping/" rel="tag">Camping</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/phev/" rel="tag">PHEV</a></p>]]></description>
      <pubDate>Thu, 23 Jul 2026 01:08:00 GMT</pubDate>
      <guid>https://newatlas.com/camping-trailers/aboard-t4-self-driving-travel-trailer/</guid>
      <dc:creator>C.C. Weiss</dc:creator>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>New wave of skincare has a powerful ingredient – the immune system</title>
      <link>https://refractor.io/aging/skincare-revolution-unexpected-place/</link>
      <description><![CDATA[<p><img src="https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/2b207c8/2147483647/strip/true/crop/5760x3840+0+0/resize/1440x960!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2Ff7%2F1a%2F74f8a23c41109296870778de1bd7%2Fdepositphotos-603073290-xl.jpg" srcset="https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/c000b6f/2147483647/strip/true/crop/5760x3840+0+0/resize/440x293!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2Ff7%2F1a%2F74f8a23c41109296870778de1bd7%2Fdepositphotos-603073290-xl.jpg 440w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/f231964/2147483647/strip/true/crop/5760x3840+0+0/resize/725x483!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2Ff7%2F1a%2F74f8a23c41109296870778de1bd7%2Fdepositphotos-603073290-xl.jpg 725w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/3f4b1e3/2147483647/strip/true/crop/5760x3840+0+0/resize/800x533!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2Ff7%2F1a%2F74f8a23c41109296870778de1bd7%2Fdepositphotos-603073290-xl.jpg 800w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/888e8a7/2147483647/strip/true/crop/5760x3840+0+0/resize/1200x800!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2Ff7%2F1a%2F74f8a23c41109296870778de1bd7%2Fdepositphotos-603073290-xl.jpg 1200w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/a0c0926/2147483647/strip/true/crop/5760x3840+0+0/resize/1920x1280!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2Ff7%2F1a%2F74f8a23c41109296870778de1bd7%2Fdepositphotos-603073290-xl.jpg 1920w" alt="There is little evidence that cosmetic products slow inflammaging in people" /><p>Yustina Yustina, King's College London/The Conversation</p><p><a href="https://refractor.io/aging/skincare-revolution-unexpected-place/">Continue Reading</a></p><p><b>Category:</b> <a href="https://refractor.io/aging/">Aging Well</a>, <a href="https://refractor.io/health-wellbeing/">Wellness and Healthy Living</a>, <a href="https://refractor.io/medical/">Body and Mind</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/rf/">Refractor: Science &amp; Health</a></p><p><b>Tags:</b> <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/skin/" rel="tag">Skin</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/microbiome/" rel="tag">Microbiome</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/probiotic/" rel="tag">Probiotic</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/inflammation/" rel="tag">Inflammation</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/immune-system/" rel="tag">The Immune System</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/t-cells/" rel="tag">T-cells</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/aging/" rel="tag">Aging</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/age-related/" rel="tag">Age-Related</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/anti-aging/" rel="tag">anti-aging</a></p>]]></description>
      <pubDate>Wed, 22 Jul 2026 22:28:40 GMT</pubDate>
      <guid>https://refractor.io/aging/skincare-revolution-unexpected-place/</guid>
      <dc:creator>The Conversation</dc:creator>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Bi-directional AWD robomower gets to grips with gnarly monster lawns</title>
      <link>https://newatlas.com/around-the-home/terramow-x-awd-robot-mower/</link>
      <description><![CDATA[<p><img src="https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/ae874b0/2147483647/strip/true/crop/2000x1126+0+0/resize/1440x811!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F8a%2Ffb%2F04ad783b4b648c2b28bfd9cf3e51%2Fterramowx-heroimg.jpg" srcset="https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/4769dd7/2147483647/strip/true/crop/2000x1126+0+0/resize/440x248!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F8a%2Ffb%2F04ad783b4b648c2b28bfd9cf3e51%2Fterramowx-heroimg.jpg 440w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/1fb3060/2147483647/strip/true/crop/2000x1126+0+0/resize/725x408!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F8a%2Ffb%2F04ad783b4b648c2b28bfd9cf3e51%2Fterramowx-heroimg.jpg 725w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/c6f2ba3/2147483647/strip/true/crop/2000x1126+0+0/resize/800x451!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F8a%2Ffb%2F04ad783b4b648c2b28bfd9cf3e51%2Fterramowx-heroimg.jpg 800w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/8f94db1/2147483647/strip/true/crop/2000x1126+0+0/resize/1200x676!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F8a%2Ffb%2F04ad783b4b648c2b28bfd9cf3e51%2Fterramowx-heroimg.jpg 1200w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/6886a89/2147483647/strip/true/crop/2000x1126+0+0/resize/1920x1081!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F8a%2Ffb%2F04ad783b4b648c2b28bfd9cf3e51%2Fterramowx-heroimg.jpg 1920w" alt="The TerraMow X AWD uses a 42-volt all-wheel-drive platform and full suspension to work large, hilly lawns that tend to strand other robot mowers" /><p>TerraMow's new X AWD rethinks how a robot mower moves, swapping the usual end-of-row pivot for a back-and-forth "Shuttle Drive" designed to handle big, steep, and messy lawns without chewing up the turf.</p><p><a href="https://newatlas.com/around-the-home/terramow-x-awd-robot-mower/">Continue Reading</a></p><p><b>Category:</b> <a href="https://newatlas.com/around-the-home/">Around The Home</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/consumer-tech/">Consumer Tech</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/technology/">Technology</a></p><p><b>Tags:</b> <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/kickstarter/" rel="tag">Kickstarter</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/mower/" rel="tag">Mower</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/lawnmowers/" rel="tag">Lawnmowers</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/robotics/" rel="tag">Robotics</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/automation/" rel="tag">Automation</a></p>]]></description>
      <pubDate>Wed, 22 Jul 2026 15:27:00 GMT</pubDate>
      <guid>https://newatlas.com/around-the-home/terramow-x-awd-robot-mower/</guid>
      <dc:creator>Monica J. White</dc:creator>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Extra-wide tiny house puts a terrace up top and sleeps five inside</title>
      <link>https://newatlas.com/tiny-houses/white-pine-backcountry-tiny-homes/</link>
      <description><![CDATA[<p><img src="https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/84e8d07/2147483647/strip/true/crop/2359x1184+0+0/resize/1440x723!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F70%2F01%2Feb61f28243eb9336371e0db4c64d%2Fwhite-pine-backcountry-tiny-house-5.jpg" srcset="https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/c9f5077/2147483647/strip/true/crop/2359x1184+0+0/resize/440x221!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F70%2F01%2Feb61f28243eb9336371e0db4c64d%2Fwhite-pine-backcountry-tiny-house-5.jpg 440w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/7b24669/2147483647/strip/true/crop/2359x1184+0+0/resize/725x364!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F70%2F01%2Feb61f28243eb9336371e0db4c64d%2Fwhite-pine-backcountry-tiny-house-5.jpg 725w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/a3397a6/2147483647/strip/true/crop/2359x1184+0+0/resize/800x402!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F70%2F01%2Feb61f28243eb9336371e0db4c64d%2Fwhite-pine-backcountry-tiny-house-5.jpg 800w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/67e5585/2147483647/strip/true/crop/2359x1184+0+0/resize/1200x603!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F70%2F01%2Feb61f28243eb9336371e0db4c64d%2Fwhite-pine-backcountry-tiny-house-5.jpg 1200w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/4a85914/2147483647/strip/true/crop/2359x1184+0+0/resize/1920x964!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F70%2F01%2Feb61f28243eb9336371e0db4c64d%2Fwhite-pine-backcountry-tiny-house-5.jpg 1920w" alt="The White Pine, by Backcountry Tiny Homes, is an extra-wide model that's topped by a rooftop terrace" /><p>Though it has a compact footprint, this tiny house expands its living area significantly with a useful rooftop terrace. Inside, it features a space-saving layout that's packed with storage and can sleep up to five people at a squeeze.</p><p><a href="https://newatlas.com/tiny-houses/white-pine-backcountry-tiny-homes/">Continue Reading</a></p><p><b>Category:</b> <a href="https://newatlas.com/tiny-houses/">Tiny Houses</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/outdoors/">Outdoors</a></p><p><b>Tags:</b> <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/micro-housing/" rel="tag">Micro-House</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/home/" rel="tag">Home</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/tiny-footprint/" rel="tag">Tiny Footprint</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/danish-mirror-house/21118/" rel="tag">House</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/building+and+construction/" rel="tag">Building and Construction</a></p>]]></description>
      <pubDate>Wed, 22 Jul 2026 13:06:09 GMT</pubDate>
      <guid>https://newatlas.com/tiny-houses/white-pine-backcountry-tiny-homes/</guid>
      <dc:creator>Adam Williams</dc:creator>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Light Flip phone takes a nostalgic approach to killing screen time</title>
      <link>https://newatlas.com/mobile-technology/light-flip-phone-reduce-screen-time/</link>
      <description><![CDATA[<p><img src="https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/db020d0/2147483647/strip/true/crop/1200x802+0+0/resize/1200x802!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2Fd6%2F2d%2Fd66428ec4585a44ac3a9d233d811%2Fthe-light-flip-looks-like-a-delightful-throwback-to-90s-clamshells.jpg" srcset="https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/36a1bbd/2147483647/strip/true/crop/1200x802+0+0/resize/440x294!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2Fd6%2F2d%2Fd66428ec4585a44ac3a9d233d811%2Fthe-light-flip-looks-like-a-delightful-throwback-to-90s-clamshells.jpg 440w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/b922dae/2147483647/strip/true/crop/1200x802+0+0/resize/725x485!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2Fd6%2F2d%2Fd66428ec4585a44ac3a9d233d811%2Fthe-light-flip-looks-like-a-delightful-throwback-to-90s-clamshells.jpg 725w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/37c71af/2147483647/strip/true/crop/1200x802+0+0/resize/800x535!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2Fd6%2F2d%2Fd66428ec4585a44ac3a9d233d811%2Fthe-light-flip-looks-like-a-delightful-throwback-to-90s-clamshells.jpg 800w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/db020d0/2147483647/strip/true/crop/1200x802+0+0/resize/1200x802!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2Fd6%2F2d%2Fd66428ec4585a44ac3a9d233d811%2Fthe-light-flip-looks-like-a-delightful-throwback-to-90s-clamshells.jpg 1200w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/0ae678b/2147483647/strip/true/crop/1200x802+0+0/resize/1920x1283!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2Fd6%2F2d%2Fd66428ec4585a44ac3a9d233d811%2Fthe-light-flip-looks-like-a-delightful-throwback-to-90s-clamshells.jpg 1920w" alt="The Light Flip looks like a delightful throwback to 90s clamshells" /><p>Light has been making anti-distraction phones for about a decade now, starting with a custom operating system and layering minimalist design on top.</p><p><a href="https://newatlas.com/mobile-technology/light-flip-phone-reduce-screen-time/">Continue Reading</a></p><p><b>Category:</b> <a href="https://newatlas.com/mobile-technology/">Mobile Technology</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/consumer-tech/">Consumer Tech</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/technology/">Technology</a></p><p><b>Tags:</b> <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/smartphone/" rel="tag">Smartphones</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/light-phone/" rel="tag">Light Phone</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/minimalist/" rel="tag">Minimalist</a></p>]]></description>
      <pubDate>Wed, 22 Jul 2026 09:38:37 GMT</pubDate>
      <guid>https://newatlas.com/mobile-technology/light-flip-phone-reduce-screen-time/</guid>
      <dc:creator>Abhimanyu Ghoshal</dc:creator>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Neuron discovery could explain why some people don't get Alzheimer's</title>
      <link>https://refractor.io/brain/alzheimers-dementia/neuron-discovery-could-explain-why-some-people-dont-get-alzheimers/</link>
      <description><![CDATA[<p><img src="https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/f26ccf0/2147483647/strip/true/crop/2000x1500+0+0/resize/1280x960!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2Fbe%2F21%2Fec370986494cadfe93e45c410d6f%2Falzheimers-brain-atrophy.jpg" srcset="https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/726778e/2147483647/strip/true/crop/2000x1500+0+0/resize/440x330!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2Fbe%2F21%2Fec370986494cadfe93e45c410d6f%2Falzheimers-brain-atrophy.jpg 440w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/cd419d9/2147483647/strip/true/crop/2000x1500+0+0/resize/725x544!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2Fbe%2F21%2Fec370986494cadfe93e45c410d6f%2Falzheimers-brain-atrophy.jpg 725w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/0bf3a83/2147483647/strip/true/crop/2000x1500+0+0/resize/800x600!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2Fbe%2F21%2Fec370986494cadfe93e45c410d6f%2Falzheimers-brain-atrophy.jpg 800w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/0df7be4/2147483647/strip/true/crop/2000x1500+0+0/resize/1200x900!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2Fbe%2F21%2Fec370986494cadfe93e45c410d6f%2Falzheimers-brain-atrophy.jpg 1200w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/43c1021/2147483647/strip/true/crop/2000x1500+0+0/resize/1920x1440!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2Fbe%2F21%2Fec370986494cadfe93e45c410d6f%2Falzheimers-brain-atrophy.jpg 1920w" alt="Comparisons of a healthy brain and one with Alzheimer's" /><p>Some brains seem to defy Alzheimer's. Even when the disease's telltale plaques and tangles are present, certain individuals remain mentally sharp well into old age. This phenomenon, known as cognitive resilience, is one of the most intriguing puzzles in neuroscience today.</p><p><a href="https://refractor.io/brain/alzheimers-dementia/neuron-discovery-could-explain-why-some-people-dont-get-alzheimers/">Continue Reading</a></p><p><b>Category:</b> <a href="https://refractor.io/brain/alzheimers-dementia/">Alzheimer&apos;s &amp; Dementia</a>, <a href="https://refractor.io/brain/">Brain Health</a>, <a href="https://refractor.io/medical/">Body and Mind</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/rf/">Refractor: Science &amp; Health</a></p><p><b>Tags:</b> <a href="https://refractor.io/tag/alzheimers-disease/" rel="tag">Alzheimer&apos;s disease</a>, <a href="https://refractor.io/tag/hippocampus/" rel="tag">hippocampus</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/neurons/" rel="tag">neurons</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/tau-protein/" rel="tag">Tau protein</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/amyloid-beta-protein/" rel="tag">Amyloid-beta protein</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/neurodegenerative-conditions/" rel="tag">Neurodegenerative conditions</a></p>]]></description>
      <pubDate>Wed, 22 Jul 2026 06:03:55 GMT</pubDate>
      <guid>https://refractor.io/brain/alzheimers-dementia/neuron-discovery-could-explain-why-some-people-dont-get-alzheimers/</guid>
      <dc:creator>Pranjal Malewar</dc:creator>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Turnkey kit converts commercial ships into drone carriers</title>
      <link>https://newatlas.com/military/turnkey-kit-converts-commercial-ships-into-drone-carriers/</link>
      <description><![CDATA[<p><img src="https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/76dff34/2147483647/strip/true/crop/1500x1544+0+0/resize/933x960!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F7b%2Fe1%2Fb807f957473f8734436fb3d525bc%2F123.png" srcset="https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/bf4a447/2147483647/strip/true/crop/1500x1544+0+0/resize/440x453!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F7b%2Fe1%2Fb807f957473f8734436fb3d525bc%2F123.png 440w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/3db8d42/2147483647/strip/true/crop/1500x1544+0+0/resize/725x746!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F7b%2Fe1%2Fb807f957473f8734436fb3d525bc%2F123.png 725w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/5a8c6dc/2147483647/strip/true/crop/1500x1544+0+0/resize/800x823!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F7b%2Fe1%2Fb807f957473f8734436fb3d525bc%2F123.png 800w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/35a887a/2147483647/strip/true/crop/1500x1544+0+0/resize/1200x1235!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F7b%2Fe1%2Fb807f957473f8734436fb3d525bc%2F123.png 1200w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/7d5e0e5/2147483647/strip/true/crop/1500x1544+0+0/resize/1920x1976!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F7b%2Fe1%2Fb807f957473f8734436fb3d525bc%2F123.png 1920w" alt="The concept will allow fixed-wing drones to be deployed from converted commercial ships" /><p>Even aircraft carriers are joining the drone age. Elbit Systems has unveiled a concept to convert standard commercial merchant ships into modular carriers capable of launching and retrieving its Hermes 650 Spark fixed-wing unmanned aircraft.</p><p><a href="https://newatlas.com/military/turnkey-kit-converts-commercial-ships-into-drone-carriers/">Continue Reading</a></p><p><b>Category:</b> <a href="https://newatlas.com/military/">Military</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/engineering/">Engineering</a></p><p><b>Tags:</b> <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/drones/" rel="tag">drones</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/aircraft-carrier/" rel="tag">Aircraft Carrier</a></p>]]></description>
      <pubDate>Wed, 22 Jul 2026 03:30:27 GMT</pubDate>
      <guid>https://newatlas.com/military/turnkey-kit-converts-commercial-ships-into-drone-carriers/</guid>
      <dc:creator>David Szondy</dc:creator>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Threat of extreme solar storms may be far worse than we imagined</title>
      <link>https://refractor.io/space/threat-of-extreme-solar-storms-may-be-far-worse-than-we-imagined/</link>
      <description><![CDATA[<p><img src="https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/4479d7f/2147483647/strip/true/crop/2000x1500+0+0/resize/1280x960!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2Fe7%2F65%2Fc3fed4974e6282487e2a0bb59422%2Fgeomag-solarwind-header.jpg" srcset="https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/ce21ce4/2147483647/strip/true/crop/2000x1500+0+0/resize/440x330!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2Fe7%2F65%2Fc3fed4974e6282487e2a0bb59422%2Fgeomag-solarwind-header.jpg 440w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/3c5b912/2147483647/strip/true/crop/2000x1500+0+0/resize/725x544!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2Fe7%2F65%2Fc3fed4974e6282487e2a0bb59422%2Fgeomag-solarwind-header.jpg 725w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/7630f33/2147483647/strip/true/crop/2000x1500+0+0/resize/800x600!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2Fe7%2F65%2Fc3fed4974e6282487e2a0bb59422%2Fgeomag-solarwind-header.jpg 800w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/eaedcb7/2147483647/strip/true/crop/2000x1500+0+0/resize/1200x900!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2Fe7%2F65%2Fc3fed4974e6282487e2a0bb59422%2Fgeomag-solarwind-header.jpg 1200w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/4ee0769/2147483647/strip/true/crop/2000x1500+0+0/resize/1920x1440!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2Fe7%2F65%2Fc3fed4974e6282487e2a0bb59422%2Fgeomag-solarwind-header.jpg 1920w" alt="Orange flames representing solar wind over Earth's surface " /><p>A theorized limit to our planet’s response to geomagnetic storms may be the product of a statistical illusion, researchers claim, revealing that the extent of damage from the most extreme solar events could be greater than we ever imagined.</p><p><a href="https://refractor.io/space/threat-of-extreme-solar-storms-may-be-far-worse-than-we-imagined/">Continue Reading</a></p><p><b>Category:</b> <a href="https://refractor.io/space/">Astronomy</a>, <a href="https://refractor.io/science/">Science</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/rf/">Refractor: Science &amp; Health</a></p><p><b>Tags:</b> <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/sun/" rel="tag">Sun</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/magnetic-field/" rel="tag">Magnetic field</a>, <a href="https://refractor.io/tag/geomagnetic/" rel="tag">geomagnetic</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/nasa/" rel="tag">NASA</a>, <a href="https://refractor.io/tag/coronal-mass-ejection/" rel="tag">coronal mass ejection</a>, <a href="https://refractor.io/tag/solar-storm/" rel="tag">solar-storm</a></p>]]></description>
      <pubDate>Wed, 22 Jul 2026 03:09:00 GMT</pubDate>
      <guid>https://refractor.io/space/threat-of-extreme-solar-storms-may-be-far-worse-than-we-imagined/</guid>
      <dc:creator>Mike McRae</dc:creator>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Norton Motorcycles amplifies comeback with gutsy adventure bike</title>
      <link>https://newatlas.com/motorcycles/norton-atlas-review/</link>
      <description><![CDATA[<p><img src="https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/f3b14df/2147483647/strip/true/crop/4232x2821+0+0/resize/1440x960!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2Fdf%2Fcc%2Ff25a35b941c9b2826595faa45125%2Fnorton-atlas-global-ab-7719.jpg" srcset="https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/214ed89/2147483647/strip/true/crop/4232x2821+0+0/resize/440x293!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2Fdf%2Fcc%2Ff25a35b941c9b2826595faa45125%2Fnorton-atlas-global-ab-7719.jpg 440w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/171512e/2147483647/strip/true/crop/4232x2821+0+0/resize/725x483!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2Fdf%2Fcc%2Ff25a35b941c9b2826595faa45125%2Fnorton-atlas-global-ab-7719.jpg 725w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/2bb3e2f/2147483647/strip/true/crop/4232x2821+0+0/resize/800x533!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2Fdf%2Fcc%2Ff25a35b941c9b2826595faa45125%2Fnorton-atlas-global-ab-7719.jpg 800w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/8e50403/2147483647/strip/true/crop/4232x2821+0+0/resize/1200x800!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2Fdf%2Fcc%2Ff25a35b941c9b2826595faa45125%2Fnorton-atlas-global-ab-7719.jpg 1200w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/745f5de/2147483647/strip/true/crop/4232x2821+0+0/resize/1920x1280!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2Fdf%2Fcc%2Ff25a35b941c9b2826595faa45125%2Fnorton-atlas-global-ab-7719.jpg 1920w" alt="New Atlas reviews the Norton Atlas" /><p>There’s something endearing about one of the world’s most prestigious motorcycle makers almost disappearing into oblivion and making a full-fledged resurgence with a fresh approach. One that’s not only strategic but equally forceful, and might I say, incredibly ballsy.</p><p><a href="https://newatlas.com/motorcycles/norton-atlas-review/">Continue Reading</a></p><p><b>Category:</b> <a href="https://newatlas.com/motorcycles/">Motorcycles</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/transport/">Transport</a></p><p><b>Tags:</b> <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/norton-motorcycle/" rel="tag">Norton Motorcycle</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/adventure-bikes/" rel="tag">Adventure Bikes</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/touring/" rel="tag">Touring</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/twin-engine/" rel="tag">Twin-engine</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/reviews/" rel="tag">Reviews</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/triumph/" rel="tag">Triumph</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/suzuki/" rel="tag">Suzuki</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/iceland/" rel="tag">Iceland</a></p>]]></description>
      <pubDate>Tue, 21 Jul 2026 23:03:00 GMT</pubDate>
      <guid>https://newatlas.com/motorcycles/norton-atlas-review/</guid>
      <dc:creator>Utkarsh Sood</dc:creator>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Cell phones don't cause brain cancer, comprehensive study shows</title>
      <link>https://refractor.io/cancer/cell-phones-dont-cause-brain-cancer-comprehensive-study-shows/</link>
      <description><![CDATA[<p><img src="https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/61aaef9/2147483647/strip/true/crop/6401x4267+0+0/resize/1440x960!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F4d%2F78%2F35a66aca444dad8f87993a7249c8%2Fdepositphotos-663581730-xl.jpg" srcset="https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/24bcf1d/2147483647/strip/true/crop/6401x4267+0+0/resize/440x293!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F4d%2F78%2F35a66aca444dad8f87993a7249c8%2Fdepositphotos-663581730-xl.jpg 440w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/cf27b1d/2147483647/strip/true/crop/6401x4267+0+0/resize/725x483!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F4d%2F78%2F35a66aca444dad8f87993a7249c8%2Fdepositphotos-663581730-xl.jpg 725w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/84b3889/2147483647/strip/true/crop/6401x4267+0+0/resize/800x533!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F4d%2F78%2F35a66aca444dad8f87993a7249c8%2Fdepositphotos-663581730-xl.jpg 800w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/5cfd712/2147483647/strip/true/crop/6401x4267+0+0/resize/1200x800!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F4d%2F78%2F35a66aca444dad8f87993a7249c8%2Fdepositphotos-663581730-xl.jpg 1200w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/f62855b/2147483647/strip/true/crop/6401x4267+0+0/resize/1920x1280!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F4d%2F78%2F35a66aca444dad8f87993a7249c8%2Fdepositphotos-663581730-xl.jpg 1920w" alt="Fears of cell phones causing cancer are unfounded" /><p>Sarah Diepstraten & John (Eddie) La Marca, WEHI (Walter and Eliza Hall Institute of Medical Research)/The Conversation</p><p><a href="https://refractor.io/cancer/cell-phones-dont-cause-brain-cancer-comprehensive-study-shows/">Continue Reading</a></p><p><b>Category:</b> <a href="https://refractor.io/cancer/">Cancer</a>, <a href="https://refractor.io/disease/">Illnesses and conditions</a>, <a href="https://refractor.io/medical/">Body and Mind</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/rf/">Refractor: Science &amp; Health</a></p><p><b>Tags:</b> <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/brain-cancer/" rel="tag">Brain cancer</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/cell-phone/" rel="tag">Cell+Phone</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/hidden-technology/" rel="tag">Hidden Technology</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/smartphone/" rel="tag">Smartphones</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/chronic-illness/" rel="tag">Chronic illness</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/disease/" rel="tag">Disease</a></p>]]></description>
      <pubDate>Tue, 21 Jul 2026 22:22:00 GMT</pubDate>
      <guid>https://refractor.io/cancer/cell-phones-dont-cause-brain-cancer-comprehensive-study-shows/</guid>
