    <item>
      <title>Leatherman launches slim Adapter ratchet-cache multitool</title>
      <link>https://newatlas.com/knives-multitools/leatherman-adapter-multitool-cache/</link>
      <description><![CDATA[<p><img src="https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/3a9ab2f/2147483647/strip/true/crop/1826x1511+0+0/resize/1160x960!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2Fc5%2Fdb%2F9849eef74bba928449c005732a26%2Fgarage-adapter-feature-image-1-copy.jpg" srcset="https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/2589ec4/2147483647/strip/true/crop/1826x1511+0+0/resize/440x364!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2Fc5%2Fdb%2F9849eef74bba928449c005732a26%2Fgarage-adapter-feature-image-1-copy.jpg 440w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/2426d0d/2147483647/strip/true/crop/1826x1511+0+0/resize/725x600!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2Fc5%2Fdb%2F9849eef74bba928449c005732a26%2Fgarage-adapter-feature-image-1-copy.jpg 725w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/8b67999/2147483647/strip/true/crop/1826x1511+0+0/resize/800x662!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2Fc5%2Fdb%2F9849eef74bba928449c005732a26%2Fgarage-adapter-feature-image-1-copy.jpg 800w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/33dfa37/2147483647/strip/true/crop/1826x1511+0+0/resize/1200x993!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2Fc5%2Fdb%2F9849eef74bba928449c005732a26%2Fgarage-adapter-feature-image-1-copy.jpg 1200w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/200c84a/2147483647/strip/true/crop/1826x1511+0+0/resize/1920x1589!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2Fc5%2Fdb%2F9849eef74bba928449c005732a26%2Fgarage-adapter-feature-image-1-copy.jpg 1920w" alt="The Adapter's biggest feature is its ratchet-equipped bit holder" /><p>Rather than encompass the "toolbox in your pocket" nature of the typical multitool, the all-new Leatherman Adapter is designed to serve as a secondary companion, the perfect partner-in-crime for a more fully loaded pocket EDC like the Arc. The Adapter folds just a little larger than Bic lighter size and expands by way of a single joint to deliver serious DIY leverage and torque. While it lacks the flippable implements of other multitools, it hides additional functions away in an onboard cache.</p><p><a href="https://newatlas.com/knives-multitools/leatherman-adapter-multitool-cache/">Continue Reading</a></p><p><b>Category:</b> <a href="https://newatlas.com/knives-multitools/">Knives and Multitools</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/outdoor-gear/">Gear</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/outdoors/">Outdoors</a></p><p><b>Tags:</b> <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/multi-tools/" rel="tag">Multitools</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/leatherman/" rel="tag">Leatherman</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/edc/" rel="tag">EDC</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/tools/" rel="tag">Tools</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/everyday-carry/" rel="tag">Everyday Carry</a></p>]]></description>
      <pubDate>Tue, 21 Jul 2026 20:37:00 GMT</pubDate>
      <guid>https://newatlas.com/knives-multitools/leatherman-adapter-multitool-cache/</guid>
      <dc:creator>C.C. Weiss</dc:creator>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>3D printing breakthrough produces custom contact lenses in 20 minutes</title>
      <link>https://newatlas.com/3d-printing/3d-printed-custom-contact-lenses-20-minutes/</link>
      <description><![CDATA[<p><img src="https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/94f9954/2147483647/strip/true/crop/3500x2333+0+0/resize/1440x960!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2Fd0%2F6f%2F1fa7d1ce4dfc9d1a6cd9f59412b1%2Fsci-221-26-3d-printing-rigid-contact-lens-article-photos-shirley-tang-12.jpg" srcset="https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/737b237/2147483647/strip/true/crop/3500x2333+0+0/resize/440x293!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2Fd0%2F6f%2F1fa7d1ce4dfc9d1a6cd9f59412b1%2Fsci-221-26-3d-printing-rigid-contact-lens-article-photos-shirley-tang-12.jpg 440w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/99ce1a0/2147483647/strip/true/crop/3500x2333+0+0/resize/725x483!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2Fd0%2F6f%2F1fa7d1ce4dfc9d1a6cd9f59412b1%2Fsci-221-26-3d-printing-rigid-contact-lens-article-photos-shirley-tang-12.jpg 725w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/dd6818a/2147483647/strip/true/crop/3500x2333+0+0/resize/800x533!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2Fd0%2F6f%2F1fa7d1ce4dfc9d1a6cd9f59412b1%2Fsci-221-26-3d-printing-rigid-contact-lens-article-photos-shirley-tang-12.jpg 800w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/1fdaf4e/2147483647/strip/true/crop/3500x2333+0+0/resize/1200x800!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2Fd0%2F6f%2F1fa7d1ce4dfc9d1a6cd9f59412b1%2Fsci-221-26-3d-printing-rigid-contact-lens-article-photos-shirley-tang-12.jpg 1200w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/edfcb04/2147483647/strip/true/crop/3500x2333+0+0/resize/1920x1280!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2Fd0%2F6f%2F1fa7d1ce4dfc9d1a6cd9f59412b1%2Fsci-221-26-3d-printing-rigid-contact-lens-article-photos-shirley-tang-12.jpg 1920w" alt="One of the custom 3D-printed contact lenses on the printing platform at the University of Waterloo’s Tang Nanotechnology Lab" /><p>Contact lens technology has come a long way. Early lenses were made from glass, and were uncomfortable to wear for an entire day. Today, lenses are made from soft materials such as silicone hydrogel and they are barely noticeable on the eye.</p><p><a href="https://newatlas.com/3d-printing/3d-printed-custom-contact-lenses-20-minutes/">Continue Reading</a></p><p><b>Category:</b> <a href="https://newatlas.com/3d-printing/">3D Printing</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/manufacturing/">Manufacturing</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/engineering/">Engineering</a></p><p><b>Tags:</b> <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/university-of-waterloo/" rel="tag">University of Waterloo</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/contact-lens/" rel="tag">Contact Lenses</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/vision/" rel="tag">Vision</a></p>]]></description>
      <pubDate>Tue, 21 Jul 2026 18:59:38 GMT</pubDate>
      <guid>https://newatlas.com/3d-printing/3d-printed-custom-contact-lenses-20-minutes/</guid>
      <dc:creator>Maryna Holovnova</dc:creator>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Stealthy EDC screwdriver hides 24 bits in a pop-up cartridge</title>
      <link>https://newatlas.com/knives-multitools/edc-screwdriver-zevor-kickstarter/</link>
      <description><![CDATA[<p><img src="https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/056ac91/2147483647/strip/true/crop/1200x941+0+0/resize/1200x941!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F6c%2F8c%2F08a9b5714904bb5c843575251c61%2Fthe-anodized-aluminum-alloy-handle-looks-terrific.jpg" srcset="https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/70d9fcd/2147483647/strip/true/crop/1200x941+0+0/resize/440x345!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F6c%2F8c%2F08a9b5714904bb5c843575251c61%2Fthe-anodized-aluminum-alloy-handle-looks-terrific.jpg 440w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/c21da83/2147483647/strip/true/crop/1200x941+0+0/resize/725x569!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F6c%2F8c%2F08a9b5714904bb5c843575251c61%2Fthe-anodized-aluminum-alloy-handle-looks-terrific.jpg 725w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/5cc9e2b/2147483647/strip/true/crop/1200x941+0+0/resize/800x627!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F6c%2F8c%2F08a9b5714904bb5c843575251c61%2Fthe-anodized-aluminum-alloy-handle-looks-terrific.jpg 800w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/056ac91/2147483647/strip/true/crop/1200x941+0+0/resize/1200x941!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F6c%2F8c%2F08a9b5714904bb5c843575251c61%2Fthe-anodized-aluminum-alloy-handle-looks-terrific.jpg 1200w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/c1f8229/2147483647/strip/true/crop/1200x941+0+0/resize/1920x1506!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F6c%2F8c%2F08a9b5714904bb5c843575251c61%2Fthe-anodized-aluminum-alloy-handle-looks-terrific.jpg 1920w" alt="The anodized aluminum alloy handle looks terrific" /><p>We've seen a couple of nifty screwdrivers that have room to hold their own driver bits. Thanks to clever design, this new one packs a whopping 24 bits in a lightweight body that's way more compact than you'd expect.</p><p><a href="https://newatlas.com/knives-multitools/edc-screwdriver-zevor-kickstarter/">Continue Reading</a></p><p><b>Category:</b> <a href="https://newatlas.com/knives-multitools/">Knives and Multitools</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/outdoor-gear/">Gear</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/outdoors/">Outdoors</a></p><p><b>Tags:</b> <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/edc/" rel="tag">EDC</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/tools/" rel="tag">Tools</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/xxkickbooster/" rel="tag">xxKickbooster</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/kickstarter/" rel="tag">Kickstarter</a></p>]]></description>
      <pubDate>Tue, 21 Jul 2026 15:27:00 GMT</pubDate>
      <guid>https://newatlas.com/knives-multitools/edc-screwdriver-zevor-kickstarter/</guid>
      <dc:creator>Abhimanyu Ghoshal</dc:creator>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>A $200 MacBook Air is real, but supplies won’t last</title>
      <link>https://newatlas.com/deals/a-200-macbook-air-is-real-but-supplies-wont-last/</link>
      <description><![CDATA[<p><img src="https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/df4bc51/2147483647/strip/true/crop/2250x1500+0+0/resize/1440x960!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F42%2Fd9%2Fa580cd88402a9292291d871cd6ff%2Fsale-327203-article-image.jpg" srcset="https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/9696c2b/2147483647/strip/true/crop/2250x1500+0+0/resize/440x293!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F42%2Fd9%2Fa580cd88402a9292291d871cd6ff%2Fsale-327203-article-image.jpg 440w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/8026e51/2147483647/strip/true/crop/2250x1500+0+0/resize/725x483!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F42%2Fd9%2Fa580cd88402a9292291d871cd6ff%2Fsale-327203-article-image.jpg 725w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/dbf7b1d/2147483647/strip/true/crop/2250x1500+0+0/resize/800x533!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F42%2Fd9%2Fa580cd88402a9292291d871cd6ff%2Fsale-327203-article-image.jpg 800w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/18cbb85/2147483647/strip/true/crop/2250x1500+0+0/resize/1200x800!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F42%2Fd9%2Fa580cd88402a9292291d871cd6ff%2Fsale-327203-article-image.jpg 1200w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/7260ec7/2147483647/strip/true/crop/2250x1500+0+0/resize/1920x1280!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F42%2Fd9%2Fa580cd88402a9292291d871cd6ff%2Fsale-327203-article-image.jpg 1920w" alt="null" /><p>TL;DR: Less than 100 units left — A refurbished 13-inch MacBook Air is $199.97 (MSRP $1,199) in grade-A condition with an Intel Core i5 and a 12-hour battery.</p><p><a href="https://newatlas.com/deals/a-200-macbook-air-is-real-but-supplies-wont-last/">Continue Reading</a></p><p><b>Category:</b> <a href="https://newatlas.com/deals/">Deals</a></p>]]></description>
