    <item>
      <title>Low back pain cut by 50% in first swimming clinical trial</title>
      <link>https://refractor.io/chronic-pain/back-pain-relief-swimming-trial/</link>
      <description><![CDATA[<p><img src="https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/6bf1930/2147483647/strip/true/crop/6720x4480+0+0/resize/1440x960!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F36%2Fb5%2F12e032834a4197388e9fe1d87b9a%2Fdepositphotos-180574616-xl.jpg" srcset="https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/ea28dc4/2147483647/strip/true/crop/6720x4480+0+0/resize/440x293!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F36%2Fb5%2F12e032834a4197388e9fe1d87b9a%2Fdepositphotos-180574616-xl.jpg 440w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/82a3c7f/2147483647/strip/true/crop/6720x4480+0+0/resize/725x483!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F36%2Fb5%2F12e032834a4197388e9fe1d87b9a%2Fdepositphotos-180574616-xl.jpg 725w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/f36ed45/2147483647/strip/true/crop/6720x4480+0+0/resize/800x533!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F36%2Fb5%2F12e032834a4197388e9fe1d87b9a%2Fdepositphotos-180574616-xl.jpg 800w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/da7cc97/2147483647/strip/true/crop/6720x4480+0+0/resize/1200x800!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F36%2Fb5%2F12e032834a4197388e9fe1d87b9a%2Fdepositphotos-180574616-xl.jpg 1200w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/8970816/2147483647/strip/true/crop/6720x4480+0+0/resize/1920x1280!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F36%2Fb5%2F12e032834a4197388e9fe1d87b9a%2Fdepositphotos-180574616-xl.jpg 1920w" alt="Swimming demonstrated to be clinically effective in treating low back pain disability" /><p>In the first study of its kind, scientists have found that swimming can provide relief from chronic low back pain. The trial suggests this exercise is clinically effective for treating this hard-to-target condition.</p><p><a href="https://refractor.io/chronic-pain/back-pain-relief-swimming-trial/">Continue Reading</a></p><p><b>Category:</b> <a href="https://refractor.io/chronic-pain">Chronic Pain</a>, <a href="https://refractor.io/disease/">Illnesses and conditions</a>, <a href="https://refractor.io/medical/">Body and Mind</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/rf/">Refractor: Science &amp; Health</a></p><p><b>Tags:</b> <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/macquarie-university/" rel="tag">Macquarie University</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/swimming/" rel="tag">Swimming</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/physical-therapy/" rel="tag">Physical therapy</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/physical-activity/" rel="tag">Physical activity</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/exercise/" rel="tag">Exercise</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/back-pain/" rel="tag">Back Pain</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/pain/" rel="tag">Pain</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/chronic-pain/" rel="tag">Chronic pain</a></p>]]></description>
      <pubDate>Tue, 21 Jul 2026 14:01:00 GMT</pubDate>
      <guid>https://refractor.io/chronic-pain/back-pain-relief-swimming-trial/</guid>
      <dc:creator>Bronwyn Thompson</dc:creator>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Anduril lets loose the Thunder with attack helicopter Wingman</title>
      <link>https://newatlas.com/military/anduril-thunder-attack-helicopter-wingman/</link>
      <description><![CDATA[<p><img src="https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/c0f3dba/2147483647/strip/true/crop/1200x630+0+0/resize/1200x630!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F94%2F45%2F6a3d7fb7455387777e1af2206691%2Fthunder.jpg" srcset="https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/673a2ee/2147483647/strip/true/crop/1200x630+0+0/resize/440x231!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F94%2F45%2F6a3d7fb7455387777e1af2206691%2Fthunder.jpg 440w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/54a1630/2147483647/strip/true/crop/1200x630+0+0/resize/725x381!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F94%2F45%2F6a3d7fb7455387777e1af2206691%2Fthunder.jpg 725w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/80f0662/2147483647/strip/true/crop/1200x630+0+0/resize/800x420!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F94%2F45%2F6a3d7fb7455387777e1af2206691%2Fthunder.jpg 800w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/c0f3dba/2147483647/strip/true/crop/1200x630+0+0/resize/1200x630!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F94%2F45%2F6a3d7fb7455387777e1af2206691%2Fthunder.jpg 1200w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/82af21e/2147483647/strip/true/crop/1200x630+0+0/resize/1920x1008!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F94%2F45%2F6a3d7fb7455387777e1af2206691%2Fthunder.jpg 1920w" alt="The Anduril Thunder" /><p>This year's Farnborough International Air Show was the venue for a major announcement by Anduril. The company has developed Thunder, a group 5 autonomous tilt-rotor attack helicopter designed as a Loyal Wingman for combat choppers.</p><p><a href="https://newatlas.com/military/anduril-thunder-attack-helicopter-wingman/">Continue Reading</a></p><p><b>Category:</b> <a href="https://newatlas.com/military/">Military</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/engineering/">Engineering</a></p><p><b>Tags:</b> <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/anduril/" rel="tag">Anduril</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/drones/" rel="tag">drones</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/helicopters/" rel="tag">Helicopters</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/farnborough-airshow/" rel="tag">Farnborough Airshow</a></p>]]></description>
      <pubDate>Tue, 21 Jul 2026 13:12:28 GMT</pubDate>
      <guid>https://newatlas.com/military/anduril-thunder-attack-helicopter-wingman/</guid>
      <dc:creator>David Szondy</dc:creator>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Princesses in Ancient Egypt were trained in their grave weapons</title>
      <link>https://refractor.io/history/princesses-ancient-egypt-trained-grave-weapons/</link>
      <description><![CDATA[<p><img src="https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/18e4aef/2147483647/strip/true/crop/2000x1500+0+0/resize/1280x960!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2Fcf%2F37%2F2a3807174beab1935ce37149bc52%2Fita-dagger.jpg" srcset="https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/1de4f84/2147483647/strip/true/crop/2000x1500+0+0/resize/440x330!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2Fcf%2F37%2F2a3807174beab1935ce37149bc52%2Fita-dagger.jpg 440w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/cfeb895/2147483647/strip/true/crop/2000x1500+0+0/resize/725x544!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2Fcf%2F37%2F2a3807174beab1935ce37149bc52%2Fita-dagger.jpg 725w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/14ba6df/2147483647/strip/true/crop/2000x1500+0+0/resize/800x600!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2Fcf%2F37%2F2a3807174beab1935ce37149bc52%2Fita-dagger.jpg 800w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/af89942/2147483647/strip/true/crop/2000x1500+0+0/resize/1200x900!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2Fcf%2F37%2F2a3807174beab1935ce37149bc52%2Fita-dagger.jpg 1200w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/22aa8a8/2147483647/strip/true/crop/2000x1500+0+0/resize/1920x1440!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2Fcf%2F37%2F2a3807174beab1935ce37149bc52%2Fita-dagger.jpg 1920w" alt="Princess Ita's dagger on a black background" /><p>Life as a daughter of royalty in Ancient Egypt may not have been all rose petals and feather fans.</p><p><a href="https://refractor.io/history/princesses-ancient-egypt-trained-grave-weapons/">Continue Reading</a></p><p><b>Category:</b> <a href="https://refractor.io/history/">Archaeology</a>, <a href="https://refractor.io/science/">Science</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/rf/">Refractor: Science &amp; Health</a></p><p><b>Tags:</b> <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/ancient/" rel="tag">ancient</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/egypt/" rel="tag">Egypt</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/mummies/" rel="tag">Mummies</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/weapons/" rel="tag">Weapons</a>, <a href="https://refractor.io/tag/pyramids/" rel="tag">pyramids</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/bones/" rel="tag">Bones</a></p>]]></description>
      <pubDate>Tue, 21 Jul 2026 09:06:00 GMT</pubDate>
      <guid>https://refractor.io/history/princesses-ancient-egypt-trained-grave-weapons/</guid>
      <dc:creator>Mike McRae</dc:creator>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>100-ton buoy earns world-first wave energy certification</title>
      <link>https://newatlas.com/energy/corpower-wave-energy-first-world-safety-certificate/</link>
      <description><![CDATA[<p><img src="https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/ecef667/2147483647/strip/true/crop/2400x1800+0+0/resize/1280x960!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2Fd3%2F48%2F80ddf5e24c6592448d8deb5c091d%2Feyjwyxroijoiznjvbnrpznlcl2zpbgvcl2vdtk44mwh2tu40zwd0uvlvrxlhlmpwzyj9-frontify-bsf9k39mswyyxy2h-r8dxo-9a81rg7br0shfz-pa9ge.jpeg" srcset="https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/d71159a/2147483647/strip/true/crop/2400x1800+0+0/resize/440x330!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2Fd3%2F48%2F80ddf5e24c6592448d8deb5c091d%2Feyjwyxroijoiznjvbnrpznlcl2zpbgvcl2vdtk44mwh2tu40zwd0uvlvrxlhlmpwzyj9-frontify-bsf9k39mswyyxy2h-r8dxo-9a81rg7br0shfz-pa9ge.jpeg 440w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/e08085f/2147483647/strip/true/crop/2400x1800+0+0/resize/725x544!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2Fd3%2F48%2F80ddf5e24c6592448d8deb5c091d%2Feyjwyxroijoiznjvbnrpznlcl2zpbgvcl2vdtk44mwh2tu40zwd0uvlvrxlhlmpwzyj9-frontify-bsf9k39mswyyxy2h-r8dxo-9a81rg7br0shfz-pa9ge.jpeg 725w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/7db400d/2147483647/strip/true/crop/2400x1800+0+0/resize/800x600!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2Fd3%2F48%2F80ddf5e24c6592448d8deb5c091d%2Feyjwyxroijoiznjvbnrpznlcl2zpbgvcl2vdtk44mwh2tu40zwd0uvlvrxlhlmpwzyj9-frontify-bsf9k39mswyyxy2h-r8dxo-9a81rg7br0shfz-pa9ge.jpeg 800w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/1da1398/2147483647/strip/true/crop/2400x1800+0+0/resize/1200x900!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2Fd3%2F48%2F80ddf5e24c6592448d8deb5c091d%2Feyjwyxroijoiznjvbnrpznlcl2zpbgvcl2vdtk44mwh2tu40zwd0uvlvrxlhlmpwzyj9-frontify-bsf9k39mswyyxy2h-r8dxo-9a81rg7br0shfz-pa9ge.jpeg 1200w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/b0fc010/2147483647/strip/true/crop/2400x1800+0+0/resize/1920x1440!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2Fd3%2F48%2F80ddf5e24c6592448d8deb5c091d%2Feyjwyxroijoiznjvbnrpznlcl2zpbgvcl2vdtk44mwh2tu40zwd0uvlvrxlhlmpwzyj9-frontify-bsf9k39mswyyxy2h-r8dxo-9a81rg7br0shfz-pa9ge.jpeg 1920w" alt="The C4 prototype has operated off Aguçadoura, northern Portugal, since 2023" /><p>A Swedish device that mimics the human heart to turn ocean swells into electricity has just cleared a hurdle that's kept wave power sidelined for decades. CorPower Ocean's C4 buoy has now passed the strictest safety test in the marine energy industry. The company behind it is now moving toward what could become the world's first commercial wave power plant.</p><p><a href="https://newatlas.com/energy/corpower-wave-energy-first-world-safety-certificate/">Continue Reading</a></p><p><b>Category:</b> <a href="https://newatlas.com/energy/">Energy</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/engineering/">Engineering</a></p><p><b>Tags:</b> <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/wave-power/" rel="tag">Wave Power</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/ocean/" rel="tag">Ocean</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/engineering/" rel="tag">Engineering</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/renewable-energy/" rel="tag">Renewable Energy</a></p>]]></description>
      <pubDate>Tue, 21 Jul 2026 08:08:57 GMT</pubDate>
      <guid>https://newatlas.com/energy/corpower-wave-energy-first-world-safety-certificate/</guid>
      <dc:creator>Omar Kardoudi</dc:creator>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>World first: Koala gets life-changing two-shot chlamydia vaccine</title>
      <link>https://newatlas.com/infectious-diseases/koala-chlamydia-vaccine-implant/</link>
      <description><![CDATA[<p><img src="https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/1c1516a/2147483647/strip/true/crop/1486x932+0+0/resize/1440x903!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F19%2F3e%2Fc98acc224f59ac04c52bd765a34e%2Fscreenshot-2026-07-14-at-11-16-39-am.png" srcset="https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/12a6b1b/2147483647/strip/true/crop/1486x932+0+0/resize/440x276!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F19%2F3e%2Fc98acc224f59ac04c52bd765a34e%2Fscreenshot-2026-07-14-at-11-16-39-am.png 440w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/c72c68c/2147483647/strip/true/crop/1486x932+0+0/resize/725x455!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F19%2F3e%2Fc98acc224f59ac04c52bd765a34e%2Fscreenshot-2026-07-14-at-11-16-39-am.png 725w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/f78334a/2147483647/strip/true/crop/1486x932+0+0/resize/800x502!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F19%2F3e%2Fc98acc224f59ac04c52bd765a34e%2Fscreenshot-2026-07-14-at-11-16-39-am.png 800w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/bda4a2c/2147483647/strip/true/crop/1486x932+0+0/resize/1200x753!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F19%2F3e%2Fc98acc224f59ac04c52bd765a34e%2Fscreenshot-2026-07-14-at-11-16-39-am.png 1200w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/a3b6431/2147483647/strip/true/crop/1486x932+0+0/resize/1920x1204!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F19%2F3e%2Fc98acc224f59ac04c52bd765a34e%2Fscreenshot-2026-07-14-at-11-16-39-am.png 1920w" alt="Dr Michael Pyne gives 18-month-old Bamse her vaccine and biodegradable implant" /><p>Ten months on from the huge news that a chlamydia vaccine had been approved for Australia's koala population, an 18-month-old female known as Bamse has become the first to receive the groundbreaking medicine in a new double-dose format that makes large-scale treatment possible.</p><p><a href="https://newatlas.com/infectious-diseases/koala-chlamydia-vaccine-implant/">Continue Reading</a></p><p><b>Category:</b> <a href="https://refractor.io/infectious-diseases/">Infectious Diseases</a>, <a href="https://refractor.io/disease/">Illnesses and conditions</a>, <a href="https://refractor.io/medical/">Body and Mind</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/rf/">Refractor: Science &amp; Health</a></p><p><b>Tags:</b> <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/queensland-university-of-technology/" rel="tag">Queensland University of Technology</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/vaccines/" rel="tag">Vaccines</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/koala/" rel="tag">Koala</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/animal-science/" rel="tag">Animal science</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/australia/" rel="tag">Australia</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/biodiversity/" rel="tag">Biodiversity</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/endangered/" rel="tag">Endangered</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/disease/" rel="tag">Disease</a></p>]]></description>
      <pubDate>Tue, 21 Jul 2026 06:30:23 GMT</pubDate>
      <guid>https://newatlas.com/infectious-diseases/koala-chlamydia-vaccine-implant/</guid>
      <dc:creator>Bronwyn Thompson</dc:creator>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Chronic fatigue's exhaustion traced to a faulty 'doorway'</title>
      <link>https://refractor.io/disease/chronic-fatigue-faulty-doorway/</link>
      <description><![CDATA[<p><img src="https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/3e966c2/2147483647/strip/true/crop/2000x1500+0+0/resize/1280x960!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2Ff2%2F64%2F4850cdef4b8d8e497a150e3a5d6f%2Ffatigued-person-desk.jpg" srcset="https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/576b7b7/2147483647/strip/true/crop/2000x1500+0+0/resize/440x330!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2Ff2%2F64%2F4850cdef4b8d8e497a150e3a5d6f%2Ffatigued-person-desk.jpg 440w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/dd00f6c/2147483647/strip/true/crop/2000x1500+0+0/resize/725x544!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2Ff2%2F64%2F4850cdef4b8d8e497a150e3a5d6f%2Ffatigued-person-desk.jpg 725w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/b41451d/2147483647/strip/true/crop/2000x1500+0+0/resize/800x600!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2Ff2%2F64%2F4850cdef4b8d8e497a150e3a5d6f%2Ffatigued-person-desk.jpg 800w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/b092f07/2147483647/strip/true/crop/2000x1500+0+0/resize/1200x900!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2Ff2%2F64%2F4850cdef4b8d8e497a150e3a5d6f%2Ffatigued-person-desk.jpg 1200w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/1278ac3/2147483647/strip/true/crop/2000x1500+0+0/resize/1920x1440!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2Ff2%2F64%2F4850cdef4b8d8e497a150e3a5d6f%2Ffatigued-person-desk.jpg 1920w" alt="Person with head on their arms" /><p>Scientists have identified a faulty cellular pathway that may help explain why people with myalgic encephalomyelitis/chronic fatigue syndrome (ME/CFS) experience such profound exhaustion, immune dysfunction, and crashes after exertion.</p><p><a href="https://refractor.io/disease/chronic-fatigue-faulty-doorway/">Continue Reading</a></p><p><b>Category:</b> <a href="https://refractor.io/disease/">Illnesses and conditions</a>, <a href="https://refractor.io/medical/">Body and Mind</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/rf/">Refractor: Science &amp; Health</a></p><p><b>Tags:</b> <a href="https://refractor.io/tag/chronic-fatigue-syndrome/" rel="tag">chronic-fatigue-syndrome</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/white-blood-cells/" rel="tag">White blood cells</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/diagnostic-tools/" rel="tag">Diagnostic tools</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/griffith-university/" rel="tag">Griffith University</a>, <a href="https://refractor.io/tag/mitochondria/" rel="tag">mitochondria</a></p>]]></description>
      <pubDate>Tue, 21 Jul 2026 04:42:51 GMT</pubDate>
      <guid>https://refractor.io/disease/chronic-fatigue-faulty-doorway/</guid>
      <dc:creator>Paul McClure</dc:creator>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>How your brain learns who to avoid after a bad experience</title>
      <link>https://refractor.io/learning-memory/how-your-brain-learns-who-to-avoid-after-a-bad-experience/</link>
      <description><![CDATA[<p><img src="https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/492afd5/2147483647/strip/true/crop/5168x3445+0+0/resize/1440x960!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F62%2Fdb%2F0ced5f89452c88717e1b1c0822dc%2Fdepositphotos-645312956-xl.jpg" srcset="https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/882703e/2147483647/strip/true/crop/5168x3445+0+0/resize/440x293!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F62%2Fdb%2F0ced5f89452c88717e1b1c0822dc%2Fdepositphotos-645312956-xl.jpg 440w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/f2d3d5f/2147483647/strip/true/crop/5168x3445+0+0/resize/725x483!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F62%2Fdb%2F0ced5f89452c88717e1b1c0822dc%2Fdepositphotos-645312956-xl.jpg 725w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/adbd5d6/2147483647/strip/true/crop/5168x3445+0+0/resize/800x533!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F62%2Fdb%2F0ced5f89452c88717e1b1c0822dc%2Fdepositphotos-645312956-xl.jpg 800w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/aedd2ad/2147483647/strip/true/crop/5168x3445+0+0/resize/1200x800!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F62%2Fdb%2F0ced5f89452c88717e1b1c0822dc%2Fdepositphotos-645312956-xl.jpg 1200w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/e0b0ce5/2147483647/strip/true/crop/5168x3445+0+0/resize/1920x1280!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F62%2Fdb%2F0ced5f89452c88717e1b1c0822dc%2Fdepositphotos-645312956-xl.jpg 1920w" alt="Scientists find how unpleasant interactions change the brain" /><p>Scientists have discovered a neural mechanism that shapes our aversion to select individuals, opening the door to understanding how the brain drives our dislike of others.</p><p><a href="https://refractor.io/learning-memory/how-your-brain-learns-who-to-avoid-after-a-bad-experience/">Continue Reading</a></p><p><b>Category:</b> <a href="https://refractor.io/learning-memory/">Learning &amp; Memory</a>, <a href="https://refractor.io/brain/">Brain Health</a>, <a href="https://refractor.io/medical/">Body and Mind</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/rf/">Refractor: Science &amp; Health</a></p><p><b>Tags:</b> <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/university-of-tokyo/" rel="tag">University of Tokyo</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/brain/" rel="tag">Brain</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/neuroscience/" rel="tag">Neuroscience</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/memory/" rel="tag">Memory</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/fear/" rel="tag">Fear</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/social-experiment/" rel="tag">Social Experiment</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/behavior/" rel="tag">Behavior</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/avoid/" rel="tag">Avoid</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/depression/" rel="tag">Depression</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/anxiety/" rel="tag">Anxiety</a></p>]]></description>
      <pubDate>Tue, 21 Jul 2026 03:22:57 GMT</pubDate>
      <guid>https://refractor.io/learning-memory/how-your-brain-learns-who-to-avoid-after-a-bad-experience/</guid>
      <dc:creator>Bronwyn Thompson</dc:creator>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>V9 electric mono-wheel tempts death but delivers big rewards: Review</title>
      <link>https://newatlas.com/urban-transport/inmotion-v9-euc-review/</link>
      <description><![CDATA[<p><img src="https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/ec0884f/2147483647/strip/true/crop/3402x2268+0+0/resize/1440x960!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F8c%2F7a%2F6b09467e4c018b059221cce4ee6b%2Fpxl-20260717-000336080-mp.jpg" srcset="https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/c0d9f1a/2147483647/strip/true/crop/3402x2268+0+0/resize/440x293!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F8c%2F7a%2F6b09467e4c018b059221cce4ee6b%2Fpxl-20260717-000336080-mp.jpg 440w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/bfb96bc/2147483647/strip/true/crop/3402x2268+0+0/resize/725x483!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F8c%2F7a%2F6b09467e4c018b059221cce4ee6b%2Fpxl-20260717-000336080-mp.jpg 725w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/feed58d/2147483647/strip/true/crop/3402x2268+0+0/resize/800x533!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F8c%2F7a%2F6b09467e4c018b059221cce4ee6b%2Fpxl-20260717-000336080-mp.jpg 800w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/e79e3cd/2147483647/strip/true/crop/3402x2268+0+0/resize/1200x800!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F8c%2F7a%2F6b09467e4c018b059221cce4ee6b%2Fpxl-20260717-000336080-mp.jpg 1200w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/0cd38fc/2147483647/strip/true/crop/3402x2268+0+0/resize/1920x1280!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F8c%2F7a%2F6b09467e4c018b059221cce4ee6b%2Fpxl-20260717-000336080-mp.jpg 1920w" alt="Like I said, EUCs are for nerds. And I'm definitely, 100% a total nerd. This thing is fun." /><p>I've never been one to shy away from trying something new, even if it's dangerous, scary, intimidating, daunting, and all the other adjectives that would make most people go "oh, hell no!"</p><p><a href="https://newatlas.com/urban-transport/inmotion-v9-euc-review/">Continue Reading</a></p><p><b>Category:</b> <a href="https://newatlas.com/urban-transport/">Urban Transport</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/transport/">Transport</a></p><p><b>Tags:</b> <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/electric+vehicle/" rel="tag">Electric Vehicles</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/scooter/" rel="tag">Scooter</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/self-balancing-unicycle/" rel="tag">Self Balancing Unicycle</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/unicycle/" rel="tag">Unicycle</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/reviews/" rel="tag">Reviews</a></p>]]></description>
      <pubDate>Tue, 21 Jul 2026 02:31:26 GMT</pubDate>
      <guid>https://newatlas.com/urban-transport/inmotion-v9-euc-review/</guid>
      <dc:creator>Joe Salas</dc:creator>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Burstner Habiton X off-road camper van features transforming interior</title>
      <link>https://newatlas.com/campervans/burstner-habiton-x-transforming-camper/</link>
      <description><![CDATA[<p><img src="https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/833ad1b/2147483647/strip/true/crop/2961x2099+0+0/resize/1354x960!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2Fd9%2F36%2F393caa0b46af8db96034c319e402%2Fbuerstner-habiton-x-hmx-6-0-black-lifestyle-urospodlogar-druck-10-print.jpg" srcset="https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/dc9dc91/2147483647/strip/true/crop/2961x2099+0+0/resize/440x312!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2Fd9%2F36%2F393caa0b46af8db96034c319e402%2Fbuerstner-habiton-x-hmx-6-0-black-lifestyle-urospodlogar-druck-10-print.jpg 440w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/ddee5d2/2147483647/strip/true/crop/2961x2099+0+0/resize/725x514!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2Fd9%2F36%2F393caa0b46af8db96034c319e402%2Fbuerstner-habiton-x-hmx-6-0-black-lifestyle-urospodlogar-druck-10-print.jpg 725w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/40061bf/2147483647/strip/true/crop/2961x2099+0+0/resize/800x567!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2Fd9%2F36%2F393caa0b46af8db96034c319e402%2Fbuerstner-habiton-x-hmx-6-0-black-lifestyle-urospodlogar-druck-10-print.jpg 800w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/1f1d82e/2147483647/strip/true/crop/2961x2099+0+0/resize/1200x851!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2Fd9%2F36%2F393caa0b46af8db96034c319e402%2Fbuerstner-habiton-x-hmx-6-0-black-lifestyle-urospodlogar-druck-10-print.jpg 1200w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/3c27b04/2147483647/strip/true/crop/2961x2099+0+0/resize/1920x1361!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2Fd9%2F36%2F393caa0b46af8db96034c319e402%2Fbuerstner-habiton-x-hmx-6-0-black-lifestyle-urospodlogar-druck-10-print.jpg 1920w" alt="The Bürstner Habiton X brings large camper van comfort in a small 4x4 camper van footprint" /><p>If you ask us, off-road camping is the best kind of camping. But hours after hours of brutal, hard-hammering, slow-crawling trail driving can also leave the body aching before you even step out of the vehicle. Unfortunately, many of the best 4x4 camper vans will require you to squeeze those aching limbs into an undersized bed at night. But the new Bürstner Habiton X gives you an agile Sprinter 144 on the trail and your own personal longitudinal bed at camp. That's all thanks to its space-optimizing transformer capabilities.</p><p><a href="https://newatlas.com/campervans/burstner-habiton-x-transforming-camper/">Continue Reading</a></p><p><b>Category:</b> <a href="https://newatlas.com/campervans/">Campervans</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/adventure-vehicles/">Adventure Vehicles</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/outdoors/">Outdoors</a></p><p><b>Tags:</b> <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/burstner/" rel="tag">burstner</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/campervan/" rel="tag">Campervan</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/off-road/" rel="tag">Off-road</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/off-grid/" rel="tag">Off-grid</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/hymer/" rel="tag">Hymer</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/transformable/" rel="tag">Transformable</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/rv/" rel="tag">RV</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/outdoor/" rel="tag">Outdoors and Camping</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/camping/" rel="tag">Camping</a></p>]]></description>
      <pubDate>Tue, 21 Jul 2026 02:03:00 GMT</pubDate>
      <guid>https://newatlas.com/campervans/burstner-habiton-x-transforming-camper/</guid>
      <dc:creator>C.C. Weiss</dc:creator>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Melatonin may have a modest effect on chronic joint and muscle pain</title>
      <link>https://refractor.io/chronic-pain/melatonin-modest-effect-chronic-pain/</link>
      <description><![CDATA[<p><img src="https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/5a03559/2147483647/strip/true/crop/2000x1500+0+0/resize/1280x960!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2Faf%2F6d%2F20d6fd5147d2af1b68a90834747b%2Fman-bed-melatonin.jpg" srcset="https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/e4a45fd/2147483647/strip/true/crop/2000x1500+0+0/resize/440x330!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2Faf%2F6d%2F20d6fd5147d2af1b68a90834747b%2Fman-bed-melatonin.jpg 440w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/0240bb1/2147483647/strip/true/crop/2000x1500+0+0/resize/725x544!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2Faf%2F6d%2F20d6fd5147d2af1b68a90834747b%2Fman-bed-melatonin.jpg 725w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/10507a7/2147483647/strip/true/crop/2000x1500+0+0/resize/800x600!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2Faf%2F6d%2F20d6fd5147d2af1b68a90834747b%2Fman-bed-melatonin.jpg 800w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/7809b3c/2147483647/strip/true/crop/2000x1500+0+0/resize/1200x900!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2Faf%2F6d%2F20d6fd5147d2af1b68a90834747b%2Fman-bed-melatonin.jpg 1200w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/16b916f/2147483647/strip/true/crop/2000x1500+0+0/resize/1920x1440!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2Faf%2F6d%2F20d6fd5147d2af1b68a90834747b%2Fman-bed-melatonin.jpg 1920w" alt="Man in bed holding his leg in pain" /><p>Dipa Kamdar/Kingston University/The Conversation</p><p><a href="https://refractor.io/chronic-pain/melatonin-modest-effect-chronic-pain/">Continue Reading</a></p><p><b>Category:</b> <a href="https://refractor.io/chronic-pain">Chronic Pain</a>, <a href="https://refractor.io/disease/">Illnesses and conditions</a>, <a href="https://refractor.io/medical/">Body and Mind</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/rf/">Refractor: Science &amp; Health</a></p><p><b>Tags:</b> <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/melatonin/" rel="tag">Melatonin</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/joints/" rel="tag">Joints</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/muscle/" rel="tag">Muscle</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/pain/" rel="tag">Pain</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/chronic-pain/" rel="tag">Chronic pain</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/medication/" rel="tag">Medication</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/immune-system/" rel="tag">The Immune System</a></p>]]></description>
      <pubDate>Mon, 20 Jul 2026 22:41:58 GMT</pubDate>
      <guid>https://refractor.io/chronic-pain/melatonin-modest-effect-chronic-pain/</guid>
      <dc:creator>The Conversation</dc:creator>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Robotic elephant-trunk gripper uses internal camera for a sense of touch</title>
      <link>https://newatlas.com/robotics/eletac-robotic-elephant-trunk-gripper-touch/</link>
      <description><![CDATA[<p><img src="https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/0c600e5/2147483647/strip/true/crop/5470x3647+0+0/resize/1440x960!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2Ff0%2F46%2Ffb37d10d43eb96ee5b4d9aa0657e%2Fdepositphotos-75059525-xl.jpg" srcset="https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/a1f8dfd/2147483647/strip/true/crop/5470x3647+0+0/resize/440x293!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2Ff0%2F46%2Ffb37d10d43eb96ee5b4d9aa0657e%2Fdepositphotos-75059525-xl.jpg 440w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/b6eb6cb/2147483647/strip/true/crop/5470x3647+0+0/resize/725x483!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2Ff0%2F46%2Ffb37d10d43eb96ee5b4d9aa0657e%2Fdepositphotos-75059525-xl.jpg 725w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/835424f/2147483647/strip/true/crop/5470x3647+0+0/resize/800x533!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2Ff0%2F46%2Ffb37d10d43eb96ee5b4d9aa0657e%2Fdepositphotos-75059525-xl.jpg 800w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/4cc0f3c/2147483647/strip/true/crop/5470x3647+0+0/resize/1200x800!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2Ff0%2F46%2Ffb37d10d43eb96ee5b4d9aa0657e%2Fdepositphotos-75059525-xl.jpg 1200w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/fa99a46/2147483647/strip/true/crop/5470x3647+0+0/resize/1920x1280!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2Ff0%2F46%2Ffb37d10d43eb96ee5b4d9aa0657e%2Fdepositphotos-75059525-xl.jpg 1920w" alt="The new gripper may not be as dextrous as a genuine elephant's trunk, but it's still pretty impressive" /><p>Evolution has already found solutions to lots of problems, so engineers more often borrow ideas from nature instead of reinventing the wheel. We’ve previously seen robots that can curl up like armadillos to protect themselves, and now researchers have developed yet another soft robotic gripper that mimics the tip of an elephant’s trunk. It’s called EleTac and, according to its creators, can actually “feel” the objects it touches.</p><p><a href="https://newatlas.com/robotics/eletac-robotic-elephant-trunk-gripper-touch/">Continue Reading</a></p><p><b>Category:</b> <a href="https://newatlas.com/robotics/">Robotics</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/engineering/">Engineering</a></p><p><b>Tags:</b> <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/japan-advanced-institute-of-science-and-technology/" rel="tag">Japan Advanced Institute of Science and Technology</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/biomimicry/" rel="tag">Biomimicry</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/elephant/" rel="tag">Elephant</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/touch/" rel="tag">Touch</a></p>]]></description>
      <pubDate>Mon, 20 Jul 2026 21:36:52 GMT</pubDate>
      <guid>https://newatlas.com/robotics/eletac-robotic-elephant-trunk-gripper-touch/</guid>
      <dc:creator>Maryna Holovnova</dc:creator>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Magnetic multitool packs secret cache and "everlasting" implement</title>
      <link>https://newatlas.com/knives-multitools/tfix-triangular-screwdriver-tool/</link>
      <description><![CDATA[<p><img src="https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/55cece3/2147483647/strip/true/crop/2720x1812+0+0/resize/1440x959!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F63%2Fcb%2F910164464c01a9d1863fce3b3094%2F0f7297dd7ec0be0a454d43df9e6f86eb-original.jpeg" srcset="https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/da70b5e/2147483647/strip/true/crop/2720x1812+0+0/resize/440x293!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F63%2Fcb%2F910164464c01a9d1863fce3b3094%2F0f7297dd7ec0be0a454d43df9e6f86eb-original.jpeg 440w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/72c8235/2147483647/strip/true/crop/2720x1812+0+0/resize/725x483!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F63%2Fcb%2F910164464c01a9d1863fce3b3094%2F0f7297dd7ec0be0a454d43df9e6f86eb-original.jpeg 725w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/da9d73c/2147483647/strip/true/crop/2720x1812+0+0/resize/800x533!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F63%2Fcb%2F910164464c01a9d1863fce3b3094%2F0f7297dd7ec0be0a454d43df9e6f86eb-original.jpeg 800w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/d8ff647/2147483647/strip/true/crop/2720x1812+0+0/resize/1200x799!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F63%2Fcb%2F910164464c01a9d1863fce3b3094%2F0f7297dd7ec0be0a454d43df9e6f86eb-original.jpeg 1200w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/88db72b/2147483647/strip/true/crop/2720x1812+0+0/resize/1920x1279!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F63%2Fcb%2F910164464c01a9d1863fce3b3094%2F0f7297dd7ec0be0a454d43df9e6f86eb-original.jpeg 1920w" alt="The extension rod helps users reach into tight spaces" /><p>Most repair tools for the DIYer are functional, but can be cumbersome to carry around. The T.Fix, however – a triangular pocket-sized tool on Kickstarter – is a balance of function, versatility and modern elegant design.</p><p><a href="https://newatlas.com/knives-multitools/tfix-triangular-screwdriver-tool/">Continue Reading</a></p><p><b>Category:</b> <a href="https://newatlas.com/knives-multitools/">Knives and Multitools</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/outdoor-gear/">Gear</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/outdoors/">Outdoors</a></p><p><b>Tags:</b> <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/tools/" rel="tag">Tools</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/kickstarter/" rel="tag">Kickstarter</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/titanium/" rel="tag">Titanium</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/edc/" rel="tag">EDC</a></p>]]></description>
      <pubDate>Mon, 20 Jul 2026 20:30:00 GMT</pubDate>
      <guid>https://newatlas.com/knives-multitools/tfix-triangular-screwdriver-tool/</guid>
      <dc:creator>Shirl Leigh</dc:creator>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Off-grid tiny house opens up almost everything to the outdoors</title>
      <link>https://newatlas.com/tiny-houses/shak-removed-tiny-homes/</link>
      <description><![CDATA[<p><img src="https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/89a2c8b/2147483647/strip/true/crop/2500x1667+0+0/resize/1440x960!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F13%2F0f%2F839f2f2644b3ab692e96da9a1ddc%2Fdownload.png" srcset="https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/f1d32f3/2147483647/strip/true/crop/2500x1667+0+0/resize/440x293!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F13%2F0f%2F839f2f2644b3ab692e96da9a1ddc%2Fdownload.png 440w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/3fcce79/2147483647/strip/true/crop/2500x1667+0+0/resize/725x483!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F13%2F0f%2F839f2f2644b3ab692e96da9a1ddc%2Fdownload.png 725w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/c5c560c/2147483647/strip/true/crop/2500x1667+0+0/resize/800x533!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F13%2F0f%2F839f2f2644b3ab692e96da9a1ddc%2Fdownload.png 800w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/234cfe7/2147483647/strip/true/crop/2500x1667+0+0/resize/1200x800!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F13%2F0f%2F839f2f2644b3ab692e96da9a1ddc%2Fdownload.png 1200w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/ad8b3d1/2147483647/strip/true/crop/2500x1667+0+0/resize/1920x1280!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F13%2F0f%2F839f2f2644b3ab692e96da9a1ddc%2Fdownload.png 1920w" alt="The Shak, by Removed Tiny Homes, is an off-grid tiny house that opens up to the outdoors with generous glazing and three separate entrances" /><p>One common way of maximizing space in a tiny house from feeling is by embracing an indoor/outdoor lifestyle, but few models lean into this idea as much as the Shak. The off-grid home opens up almost its entire interior to the outside – even including the bathroom.</p><p><a href="https://newatlas.com/tiny-houses/shak-removed-tiny-homes/">Continue Reading</a></p><p><b>Category:</b> <a href="https://newatlas.com/tiny-houses/">Tiny Houses</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/outdoors/">Outdoors</a></p><p><b>Tags:</b> <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/building+and+construction/" rel="tag">Building and Construction</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/tiny-footprint/" rel="tag">Tiny Footprint</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/micro-housing/" rel="tag">Micro-House</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/danish-mirror-house/21118/" rel="tag">House</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/home/" rel="tag">Home</a></p>]]></description>
      <pubDate>Mon, 20 Jul 2026 18:48:11 GMT</pubDate>
      <guid>https://newatlas.com/tiny-houses/shak-removed-tiny-homes/</guid>
      <dc:creator>Adam Williams</dc:creator>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Sony makes us wait 9 years for new superzoom bridge camera</title>
      <link>https://newatlas.com/photography/sony-rx10-v-superzoom-bridge-camera/</link>
      <description><![CDATA[<p><img src="https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/2085061/2147483647/strip/true/crop/4547x2921+0+0/resize/1440x925!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F4b%2F88%2F44d66cba414db30b39b5bf6224ce%2Frx10-v-sit-0251.jpg" srcset="https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/118f3be/2147483647/strip/true/crop/4547x2921+0+0/resize/440x283!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F4b%2F88%2F44d66cba414db30b39b5bf6224ce%2Frx10-v-sit-0251.jpg 440w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/2773bd1/2147483647/strip/true/crop/4547x2921+0+0/resize/725x466!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F4b%2F88%2F44d66cba414db30b39b5bf6224ce%2Frx10-v-sit-0251.jpg 725w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/a84848b/2147483647/strip/true/crop/4547x2921+0+0/resize/800x514!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F4b%2F88%2F44d66cba414db30b39b5bf6224ce%2Frx10-v-sit-0251.jpg 800w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/ccd8abb/2147483647/strip/true/crop/4547x2921+0+0/resize/1200x771!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F4b%2F88%2F44d66cba414db30b39b5bf6224ce%2Frx10-v-sit-0251.jpg 1200w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/4c6bcc2/2147483647/strip/true/crop/4547x2921+0+0/resize/1920x1233!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F4b%2F88%2F44d66cba414db30b39b5bf6224ce%2Frx10-v-sit-0251.jpg 1920w" alt="The Sony RX10 V pairs a fixed 24-600mm equivalent ZEISS zoom with a body and control layout borrowed from Sony's Alpha mirrorless cameras" /><p>Fixed-lens cameras have recently been enjoying a comeback as photographers look for something better than a phone without committing to a bag full of heavy lenses. That trend has been playing out across Sony's own RX range, from pocketable compacts up to the full-frame RX1R III, and now the company is bringing back its all-in-one superzoom bridge camera.</p><p><a href="https://newatlas.com/photography/sony-rx10-v-superzoom-bridge-camera/">Continue Reading</a></p><p><b>Category:</b> <a href="https://newatlas.com/photography/">Photography</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/consumer-tech/">Consumer Tech</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/technology/">Technology</a></p><p><b>Tags:</b> <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/sony/" rel="tag">Sony</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/cameras/" rel="tag">Cameras</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/super-zoom/" rel="tag">Super-Zoom</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/compact/" rel="tag">Compact</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/all-in-one/" rel="tag">All-in-one</a></p>]]></description>
      <pubDate>Mon, 20 Jul 2026 13:33:57 GMT</pubDate>
      <guid>https://newatlas.com/photography/sony-rx10-v-superzoom-bridge-camera/</guid>
      <dc:creator>Monica J. White</dc:creator>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Work finally begins on 2 World Trade Center supertall skyscraper</title>
      <link>https://newatlas.com/architecture/2-world-trade-center-skyscraper/</link>
      <description><![CDATA[<p><img src="https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/bb36135/2147483647/strip/true/crop/2000x1220+0+0/resize/1440x878!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F3c%2Fa6%2F98f375bc4689978ad32a4b69df0c%2Famex-bldg-nyc-looking-up-credit-foster-partners.jpg" srcset="https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/dfd2bad/2147483647/strip/true/crop/2000x1220+0+0/resize/440x268!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F3c%2Fa6%2F98f375bc4689978ad32a4b69df0c%2Famex-bldg-nyc-looking-up-credit-foster-partners.jpg 440w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/00afb96/2147483647/strip/true/crop/2000x1220+0+0/resize/725x442!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F3c%2Fa6%2F98f375bc4689978ad32a4b69df0c%2Famex-bldg-nyc-looking-up-credit-foster-partners.jpg 725w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/b09c5d5/2147483647/strip/true/crop/2000x1220+0+0/resize/800x488!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F3c%2Fa6%2F98f375bc4689978ad32a4b69df0c%2Famex-bldg-nyc-looking-up-credit-foster-partners.jpg 800w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/7099425/2147483647/strip/true/crop/2000x1220+0+0/resize/1200x732!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F3c%2Fa6%2F98f375bc4689978ad32a4b69df0c%2Famex-bldg-nyc-looking-up-credit-foster-partners.jpg 1200w,https://assets.newatlas.com/dims4/default/96e5670/2147483647/strip/true/crop/2000x1220+0+0/resize/1920x1171!/format/webp/quality/90/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fnewatlas-brightspot.s3.ap-southeast-2.amazonaws.com%2F3c%2Fa6%2F98f375bc4689978ad32a4b69df0c%2Famex-bldg-nyc-looking-up-credit-foster-partners.jpg 1920w" alt="2 World Trade Center will rise to 1,226 ft (373.7 m) in New York City, making it a supertall skyscraper" /><p>Construction has officially begun on New York City's most high-profile new supertall skyscraper. Rising to a height of 1,226 ft (373.7 m), 2 World Trade Center will finally complete the rebuilt World Trade Center skyline.</p><p><a href="https://newatlas.com/architecture/2-world-trade-center-skyscraper/">Continue Reading</a></p><p><b>Category:</b> <a href="https://newatlas.com/architecture/">Architecture</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/engineering/">Engineering</a></p><p><b>Tags:</b> <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/building+and+construction/" rel="tag">Building and Construction</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/skyscrapers/" rel="tag">Skyscrapers</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/new-york/" rel="tag">New York</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/foster-and-foster/" rel="tag">Foster and Partners</a>, <a href="https://newatlas.com/tag/office/" rel="tag">Office</a></p>]]></description>
      <pubDate>Mon, 20 Jul 2026 12:38:01 GMT</pubDate>
      <guid>https://newatlas.com/architecture/2-world-trade-center-skyscraper/</guid>
      <dc:creator>Adam Williams</dc:creator>
    </item>
  </channel>
</rss>
